<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ekitabo Ekiyitibwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yobu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu n’eby’Amaka ge byonna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Waaliwo omusajja mu nsi ya Uzzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Uzzi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yali nsi eyali ku luuyi olw’ebuvanjuba olw’omugga Yoludaani. Yobu teyali Muyisirayiri.</char></note> erinnya lye Yobu; yali muntu ataliiko kya kunenyezebwa, nga wa mazima, eyeewalanga ekibi, era ng’atya Katonda. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Yalina abaana aboobulenzi musanvu n’aboobuwala basatu. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Mu byobugagga ebingi ennyo bye yalina; mwe mwali endiga kasanvu, eŋŋamira enkumi ssatu, emigogo gy’ente ezirima ebikumi bitaano, endogoyi enkazi ebikumi bitaano, n’abaddu bangi nnyo nnyini; yali mwatiikirivu okusinga abantu abalala bonna mu nsi z’ebuvanjuba.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Batabani be baakwatanga embaga z’amazaalibwa gaabwe buli omu mu mpalo ng’ennaku zaabwe bwe zaali ziddiriŋŋananga mu maka ga buli omu; era baayitanga bannyinaabwe bonsatule okubajagulizaangako. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Ennaku z’embaga bwe zaggwangako, Yobu yabatumyanga n’abatukuza;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etteeka lya Musa nga terinnabaawo, omukulu w’ennyumba ye yabanga kabona w’ennyumba ye.</char></note> yakeeranga mu makya n’abaweerangayo ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa ng’omuwendo gwabwe bwe gwali ng’alowooza nti, “Oboolyawo ng’abaana bange bayonoonye ne bavvoola Katonda mu mitima gyabwe.” Kino yakikolanga bulijjo.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Setaani Agezesa Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Olunaku lumu, bamalayika ne bajja mu maaso ga <char style="nd">Mukama</char>, ne Setaani naye n’ajjiramu. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/><char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’abuuza Setaani nti, “Ova wa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Setaani n’addamu <char style="nd">Mukama</char> nti, “Nva kutalaaga nsi yonna okulaba ebintu nga bwe biri.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda n’abuuza Setaani nti, “Weetegerezza omuddu wange Yobu, atalina amufaanana, anzisaamu ekitiibwa, ataliiko kyakunenyezebwa era eyeewala buli ngeri yonna eyinza okukozesa omuntu ebibi?”<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Setaani n’addamu <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda nti, “Ekitiibwa akussaamu kya bwereere? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Tomukozeeko lukomera ye n’ennyumba ye, n’eby’obugagga by’alina? Buli ky’akola okiwadde omukisa; n’eby’obugagga bye byeyongedde nnyo obungi! <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Kale geza okwate ku by’alina obimuggyeko olabe nga taakwegaane nga n’ensi yonna eraba!” <verse eid="JOB 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/><char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda n’agamba Setaani nti, “Byonna by’alina biri mu mikono gyo, naye togeza n’okwata ku bulamu bwe.” Oluvannyuma lw’ebyo Setaani n’ava mu maaso ga <char style="nd">Mukama</char>.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yobu afiirwa Abaana be n’eby’Obugagga bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Awo olunaku lumu, batabani ba Yobu ne bawala be bwe baali banywa omwenge era nga baliira ebyassava mu maka ga mukulu waabwe, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>omubaka n’ajja eri Yobu n’amugamba nti, “Ente zibadde zirima nga n’endogoyi ziri kumpi nazo, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Abaseba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abaseba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baali balunzi abaatambulanga okuva mu kifo ekimu nga balaga mu kirala, nga babeera mu bukiikaddyo bwa Buwalabu.</char></note> ne bazigwako ne bazitwala era n’abaddu bonna ne babatta nze nsigaddewo nzekka okujja okukutegeeza bino.”<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Oyo aba akyayogera ebyo, laba, omubaka omulala n’atuuka naye n’amugamba nti, “Omuliro gubuubuuse nga guva mu ggulu ne gusaanyaawo endiga zonna n’abasumba baazo, nze nsigaddewo nzekka okukutegeeza bino.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>N’oyo aba akyayogera, n’omubaka omulala n’atuuka, n’agamba nti, “Abakaludaaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abakaludaaya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baali batambuze mu ddungu okuva mu kifo ekimu okudda mu kirala nga babeera mu Mesopotamiya. Oluvannyuma baasalawo okubeera mu kifo kimu ne bassaawo Obwakabaka bw’e Babulooni.</char></note> bazze nga beetegese mu bibinja bisatu, ne bagwa ku ŋŋamira ne bazitwala era ne batta n’abaddu ababadde bazirabirira, era nze nzekka nze nsigaddewo okujja okukumanyisa bino.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Aba akyayogera, laba, n’omulala n’ajja n’amugamba nti, “Batabani bo ne bawala bo babadde baliira era nga banywera omwenge mu nnyumba ya mukulu waabwe, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>laba, omuyaga ogw’amaanyi guvudde mu ddungu ne gugoyaagoya ennyumba yonna mwe babadde era bonna bafiiriddemu nze mponyeewo nzekka okujja okukubikira.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Yobu olwawulira bino byonna, n’agolokoka n’ayuza ebyambalo bye n’amwa omutwe gwe, n’avuunama n’asinza: <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>n’agamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Nazaalibwa sirina kantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">era bwe ntyo bwe ndiddayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ye yawa era <char style="nd">Mukama</char> y’aggyeewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">erinnya lya <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda lyebazibwe.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Mu bino byonna Yobu teyayonoona kubanga teyeemulugunyiza Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Obulamu bwa Yobu Bukwatibwako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Ku lunaku olulala bamalayika ne bajja okukiika mu maaso ga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda, ne Setaani naye n’ajjiramu. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/><char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda n’abuuza Setaani nti, “Ova wa?” Setaani n’amuddamu nti, “Nva kutalaaga ensi yonna.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda n’agamba Setaani nti, “Olowoozezza ku muddu wange Yobu? Talina kyakunenyezebwa, mwesimbu, atya Katonda era eyeewala ekibi bw’atyo talina amufaanana. Anywezezza obutuukirivu bwe newaakubadde nga wansokasoka mmuzikirize awatali nsonga.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Setaani n’amuddamu nti, “Eddiba olw’eddiba, omuntu kyaliva awaayo byonna by’alina olw’okuwonya obulamu bwe; <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>naye golola omukono gwo okwate ku magumba ge n’omubiri gwe olabe oba taakwegaane.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda n’amugamba nti, “Weewaawo, ali mu mukono gwo, kyokka mulekere obulamu bwe.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Awo Setaani n’ava awali <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Katonda, n’alwaza Yobu amayute amazibu okuva ku mutwe, okutuukira ddala ku bigere. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Yobu n’atandika okweyaguzanga oluggyo ng’eno bw’atudde mu vvu.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Kyokka mukyala we n’amugamba nti, “Okyagugubidde ku butuukirivu bwo? Weegaane Katonda ofe!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Naye ye n’amuddamu nti, “Oyogera ng’omu ku bakazi abatategeera bwe bandyogedde! Tunaafunanga birungi byereere mu mukono gwa Katonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Mu bino byonna Yobu teyayonoona na kamwa ke.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikwano gya Yobu Abasatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Awo mikwano gya Yobu abasatu; Erifaazi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Erifaazi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yali Mumowaabu eyabeeranga mu Temani.</char></note> Omutemani, Birudaadi Omusuki, ne Zofali Omunaamasi bwe baawulira emitawaana egyali gituuse ku mukwano gwabwe, ne bajja buli omu okuva ewuwe ne basisinkana nga bwe baali bateesezza, bagende bamusaasire bamuzzeemu amaanyi. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Tebaamutegeererawo nga bakyali wala, olw’embeera gye yalimu; ne bayimusa amaloboozi gaabwe ne bakuba ebiwoobe ne bayuza ebyambalo byabwe ne bayiwa enfuufu ku mitwe gyabwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Awo ne batuula naye we yali atudde okumala ennaku musanvu emisana n’ekiro nga tewali anyega, olw’obulumi obungi Yobu bwe yalimu.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Akolimira Olunaku kwe Yazaalirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Oluvannyuma lw’ebyo, Yobu n’ayasamya akamwa ke n’akolimira olunaku kwe yazaalirwa. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>N’agamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“Olunaku kwe nazaalirwa luzikirire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">n’ekiro lwe kyalangirirwa nti omwana mulenzi.<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Olunaku olwo lubuutikirwe ekizikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">omusana guleme okulwakako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Katonda aleme okulufaako.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Ekizikiza n’ekisiikirize eky’okufa birujjule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ekire kirutuuleko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ekizikiza kikankanye ekitangaala kyalwo.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Ekizikiza ekikutte be zigizigi kirunyage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">luleme okubalirwa awamu n’ennaku eziri mu mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">wadde okuyingizibwa mu ezo eziri mu mwezi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Yee, lubeere lugumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">waleme okuba eddoboozi lyonna ery’essanyu eririwulirwako.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Abo abakolimira ennyanja n’ennaku balukolimire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">n’abo abamanyi okuzuukusa agasolo galukwata mu nnyanja, balukolimire.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Emmunyeenye ez’omu matulutulu gaalwo zibe ekizikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">lulindirire ekitangaala kirubulwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">luleme okulaba ebikowe by’oku nkya.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Kubanga terwaggala nzigi za lubuto lwa mmange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">nneme okulaba obuyinike.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Lwaki saafa nga nzalibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">oba ne nfa nga nva mu lubuto lwa mmange?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Lwaki amaviivi ganzikiriza okugatuulako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">era n’amabeere okugayonka?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Kaakano nandibadde ngalamidde nga neesirikidde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">nandibadde neebase nga neewummulidde,<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>wamu ne bakabaka n’abakungu ab’ensi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">abezimbira embiri kaakano amatongo,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>oba n’abalangira abaalina zaabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">abajjuzanga ffeeza mu nnyumba zaabwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Oba lwaki saaziikibwa ng’omwana azaaliddwa ng’afudde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">atalabye ku kitangaala?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Eyo ababi gye batatawaanyizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">era n’abakooye gye bawummulira.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Abasibe gye bawummulira awamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">gye batawulirira kiragiro ky’oyo abaduumira.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Abakopi n’abakungu gye babeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">abaddu gye batatuntuzibwa bakama baabwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>“Lwaki omuyinike aweebwa ekitangaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">ne kimulisiza oyo alumwa mu mwoyo,<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>era lwaki yeegomba okufa naye ne kutajja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">n’akunoonya okusinga obugagga obuziikiddwa,<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>abajaguza ekisukkiridde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">ne basanyuka ng’atuuse ku ntaana?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Lwaki okuwa ekitangaala oyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">atayinza kulaba kkubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">Katonda gw’akomedde?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Kubanga nkaaba mu kifo ky’okulya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">n’okusinda kwange kufukumuka ng’amazzi.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Ekintu kye nantiiranga ddala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">era kye nakyawa kye kyantukako.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Siwummudde wadde okusiriikirira wadde okuba n’emirembe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">wabula buzibu bwereere bwe bunzijidde.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Erifaazi Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Awo Erifaazi Omutemani n’ayanukula ng’agamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Omuntu bw’anaayogera naawe onoonyiiga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Naye ani ayinza okusirika obusirisi?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Laba, wayigiriza bangi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">emikono eminafu wagizzaamu amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Ebigambo byo byanyweza abaali bagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">era ng’ozzaamu amaanyi amaviivi agaali gakankana.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Naye kaakano kikutuuseeko, oweddemu amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">kikutte ku ggwe n’oggwaawo!<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Okutya Katonda wo si bwe bwesige bwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">n’obwesimbu bwo si ly’essuubi lyo?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Kaakano lowooza; ani ataliiko musango eyali azikiridde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Oba wa abatuukirivu gye baali bamaliddwawo?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Okusinziira ku kyendabye; abo abateekateeka okukola ebibi era ne basiga ebitali bya butuukirivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">bakungula bizibu.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Bazikirizibwa omukka Katonda gw’assa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">bamalibwawo obusungu bwe.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Okuwuluguma kw’empologoma, n’eddoboozi ly’empologoma enkambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">n’amannyo g’empologoma ento gamenyeka.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Empologoma ey’amaanyi ezikirira olw’okubulwa omuyiggo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">n’obwana bw’empologoma busaasaana.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Nategeezebwa ekigambo eky’ekyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ne nkitegera okutu.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Wakati mu birowoozo n’okwolesebwa kw’ekiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ng’otulo otungi tukutte omuntu,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>okutya n’okukankana byankwata ne bireetera amagumba gange okunyegenya.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Omwoyo gw’ayita mu maaso gange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">obwoya bw’oku mubiri gwange ne buyimirira.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Ne buyimirira butengerera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">naye saasobola kwetegereza ndabika yaabwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">n’ekifaananyi kyali mu maaso gange, ne wabaawo akasiriikiriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ne ndyoka mpulira eddoboozi nga ligamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Omuntu afa ayinza okuba omutuukirivu okusinga Katonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Omuntu ayinza okuba omulongoofu okusinga Omutonzi we?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Obanga abaddu be tabeesiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">nga bamalayika be abalanga ensobi<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>kale kiriba kitya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">abo abasula mu z’ebbumba ezirina emisingi egiri mu nfuufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ababetentebwa n’okusinga ekiwojjolo?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Bamalibwawo wakati w’amakya n’akawungeezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">bazikirira emirembe n’emirembe awatali abafaako.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Omuguwa gwa weema yaabwe gusimbulwa munda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">ne bafa ng’abasirusiru.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Koowoola kaakano, waliwo anaakuyitaba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Era ani ku batukuvu gw’onoolaajaanira?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Obukyayi butta atalina magezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">n’obuggya butta omusirusiru.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Ndabye abasirusiru nga banywevu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">naye mangu ddala ne nkolimira ekifo kye batuulamu.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Abaana baabwe tebalina bukuumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">babetenterwa mu luggya nga tewali abawolereza.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Omuyala alya amakungula gaabwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">era atwala n’ag’omu maggwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">era awankirawankira eby’obugagga byabwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Kubanga okulaba ennaku tekuva mu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">wadde obuzibu okuva mu ttaka,<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>wabula abantu bazaalibwa kulaba nnaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">ng’ensasi bwe zibuuka waggulu.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>Naye nze, nzija kunoonya Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">era mmulekere ensonga zange.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Akola ebikulu, ebitanoonyezeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ebyewuunyisa ebitabalika.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Atonnyesa enkuba ku nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">n’aweereza amazzi mu byalo.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Ayimusa abo abanyigirizibwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">n’abo abakaaba ne basitulibwa mu mirembe.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Aziyiza enkwe z’ababi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">emikono gyabwe gireme okutuukiriza bye bateesa.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Agwikiririza abagezigezi mu bukujjukujju bwabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">n’enkwe zaabwe n’aziziyiriza ddala.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Ekizikiza kibabuutikira emisana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">ne bawammanta mu ttuntu ng’ekiro.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Naye aggya abali mu bwetaavu mu mukono gw’abo ab’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">n’abawonya ekitala kyabwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Abaavu ne balyoka baba n’essuubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">n’akamwa k’abatali benkanya ne kazibibwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Alina omukisa omuntu Katonda gw’abuulirira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">noolwekyo tonyooma kukangavvula kw’oyo Ayinzabyonna.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Kubanga ye y’afumita ate era y’anyiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">y’alumya era y’awonya.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Alikuwonya mu buzibu bwa ngeri mukaaga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">Weewaawo ne mu ngeri musanvu tootuukibwengako kulumizibwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Mu njala alikuwonya okufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">era anaakuwonyanga mu lutalo olw’ekitala.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Onookuumibwanga eri olulimi olukambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">era tootyenga okuzikirira bwe kunaabanga kujja gy’oli.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Oliseka ng’okuzikirira n’enjala bizze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">era tootyenga nsolo nkambwe ez’oku nsi.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Onoobanga n’enkolagana n’amayinja ag’omu nnimiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">era onoobanga n’emirembe awali ensolo enkambwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Olimanya nti, ensiisira yo eri mirembe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">era eby’obugagga byo olibibala n’olaba nga tewali kibuzeeko.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Olimanya ng’ezzadde lyo liriba ddene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ne bazzukulu bo baliba bangi ng’omuddo ogw’oku nsi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Olituusibwa ku ntaana yo nga wakaddiyira ddala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">ng’eŋŋaano bwe tuukira mu kiseera kyayo.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Ekyo twakyekenneenya, kituufu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">Kimanye nga kikwata ku ggwe.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Yobu n’ayanukula ng’agamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>“Singa okweraliikirira kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">n’okubonaabona kwange bipimibwa ne biteekebwa ku minzaani!<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Weewaawo byandisinze omusenyu gw’ennyanja okuzitowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ebigambo byange kyenvudde mbyanguyiriza.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Obusaale bwa Ayinzabyonna buli mu nze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">n’omwoyo gwange gunywedde obusagwa bwabwo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">entiisa ya Katonda erwana nange.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Entulege ekaaba awali omuddo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">oba ente ennume eŋŋooŋŋa awali emmere yaayo?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Emmere etaliimu nsa eriika omutali munnyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">oba amazzi g’eggi okubaamu akawoomerera?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Omutima gwange tegusikirizibwa kubikombako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">biri ng’emmere etangasa.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>“Singa Katonda ampa kye nsaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">n’ampa kye nsuubira,<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>yandisiimye okumbetenta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ne mmalibwawo omukono gwe.<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Kino kyandikkakkanyizza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">obulumi obutakoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">kubanga sigaanye bigambo bya Mutukuvu.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>Amaanyi ngaggya wa, ndyoke mbe n’essuubi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Era enkomerero yange, eruwa ndyoke ngumiikirize?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Amaanyi gange ga mayinja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">oba omubiri gwange gwa kikomo?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Mu mazima sirina maanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">n’obusobozi bwanzigwako.<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>Oyo agaana ebyekisa okuva eri mukwano gwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">tafaayo kutya Ayinzabyonna.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Baganda bange tebeesigika, bali ng’akagga akabooga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">ate ne kakalira,<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>akaddugalirira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">buli lwe kakwata, ng’omuzira,<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>ate ne kaggwaawo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">buli lwe wabaawo ebbugumu.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Ebibinja by’abatambuze we biviira ku mugendo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ne biraga mu ddungu ne bizikirira.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Abatambuze b’e Teema banoonya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">bo ab’e Seeba ne balindirira n’essuubi.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Baalina essuubi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">naye bwe baatuukayo ne banyolwa nnyo.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Kaakano bwe mundabye ne mutya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ne mukakasizza ddala nga temuliiko kye muyinza kukola.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Nnali mbagambye nti, ‘Mumpe ekirabo,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">oba nti, ‘Mumpeereyo ekintu ku by’obugagga bwammwe,<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>okumponya nve mu mukono gw’omulabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">n’okumpeerayo ekintu mpone emitego gy’abakambwe’? <verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Njigiriza nange n’aba musirise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ndaga we nsobezza.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Ebigambo eby’amazima nga bya bulumi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Naye okuwakana kwammwe kukakasa ki?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Mugezaako okugolola ebigambo byange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">ne mufuula ebigambo by’omuntu ali obubi okuba ng’empewo?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Mukubira ne bamulekwa akalulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ate ne mukubira ne mukwano gwammwe.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>“Naye kaakano mubeere ba kisa muntunuulire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Ndabika ng’omulimba?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Mufumiitirize, temusuula bwenkanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">Mukirowoozeeko, kubanga obujulirwa bwange buli ku kalebwerebwe.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Emimwa gyange girabika ng’egirimba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Emimwa gyange tegisobola kutegeera ttima?”<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>“Ebiseera by’omuntu ku nsi, tebyagerebwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Ennaku ze tezaagerebwa nga ez’omupakasi?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Ng’omuddu eyeegomba ekisiikirize okujja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ng’omupakasi bwe yeesunga empeera ye;<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>bwe ntyo bwe nnaweebwa emyezi egy’okubonaabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ebiro ebyokutegana bwe byangererwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Bwe ngalamira neebake, njogera nti, ‘Ndiyimuka ddi, ekiro kinaakoma ddi?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Nga nzijudde okukulungutana okutuusa obudde lwe bukya.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Omubiri gwange gujjudde envunyu n’ebikakampa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">n’olususu lwange lukutusekutuse era lulabika bubi.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>“Ennaku zange zidduka okusinga ekyuma ky’omulusi w’engoye bw’atambuza ky’alusisa engoye ze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">era zikoma awatali ssuubi.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Ojjukira Ayi Katonda, nti obulamu bwange tebuliimu, wabula mukka bukka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">amaaso gange tegaliddayo kulaba bulungi.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Eriiso ly’oyo eryali lindabyeko teririddayo kundaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">amaaso gammwe galinnoonya, naye nga sikyaliwo.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Nga ekire bwe kibulawo ne kigenda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">bw’atyo n’aziikwa mu ntaana talivaayo.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Taliddayo mu nnyumba ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">amaka ge tegaliddayo kumumanya nate.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>Noolwekyo sijja kuziyiza kamwa kange, nzija kwogera okulumwa kw’omutima gwange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">nzija kwemulugunyiza mu bulumi bw’emmeeme yange.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Ndi nnyanja oba ndi lukwata ow’omu buziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">olyoke onkuume?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Bwe ndowooza nti, obuliri bwange bunampa ku mirembe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ekiriri kyange kinakendeeza ku kulumwa kwange;<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>n’olyoka ontiisa n’ebirooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">era n’onkanga okuyita mu kwolesebwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Emmeeme yange ne yeegomba okwetuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">nfe okusinga okuba omulamu.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Sikyeyagala, neetamiddwa. Sijja kubeera mulamu emirembe gyonna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Ndeka; kubanga ennaku zange butaliimu.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>Omuntu kye ki ggwe okumugulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">n’omulowoozaako?<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Bw’otyo n’omwekebejja buli makya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">n’omugezesa buli kaseera?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Olituusa ddi nga tonvuddeeko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">n’ondeka ne mmira ku malusu?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Nyonoonye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">kiki kye nakukola, ggwe omukuumi w’abantu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Lwaki onfudde nga akabonero ak’obulabe gy’oli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ne neefuukira omugugu?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Era lwaki tosonyiwa kwonoona kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">n’oggyawo obutali butuukirivu bwange?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Kubanga kaakano nzija kwebaka mu ntaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">era ojja kunnoonya ku makya naye naaba sikyaliwo.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Birudaadi Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Awo Birudaadi Omusukusi n’addamu n’agamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Onookoma ddi okwogera ebintu bino?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Era ebigambo bino by’oyogera n’akamwa ko binaakoma ddi okuba ng’empewo ey’amaanyi?<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Katonda akyusakyusa mu nsala ye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Oba oyo Ayinzabyonna akyusakyusa amazima?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Abaana bo bwe baayonoona eri <char style="nd">Mukama</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">n’abawaayo eri empeera y’ekibi kyabwe.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Kyokka bw’onoonoonya Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">ne weegayirira oyo Ayinzabyonna,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>bw’onooba omulongoofu era ow’amazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">ddala ddala anaakuddiramu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">n’akuzzaayo mu kifo kyo ekituufu.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Wadde ng’entandikwa yo yali ntono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">embeera yo ey’enkomerero ejja kuba nnungi ddala.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Buuza ku mirembe egy’edda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">era onoonyereze ku bakitaabwe bye baayiga;<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>kubanga ffe twazaalibwa jjuuzi era tetulina kye tumanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">era ne nnaku ze twakamala ku nsi ziri ng’ekisiikirize.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Tebaakulage bakumanyise era bakutegeeze ebigambo bye mitima gyabwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">oba by’okutegeera kwabwe?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Ebitoogo biyinza okumera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">awatali bitosi?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Biba bikyakula nga tebinnasalibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">bikala mangu okusinga omuddo.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Bw’etyo enkomerero bw’ebeera ey’abo bonna abeerabira Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">essuubi ly’abatatya Katonda bwe libula.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Ebyo bye yeesiga byatika mangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ebyo bye yeesiga, nnyumba ya nnabbubi!<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Yeesigama wuzi za nnabbubi ne zikutuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">azeekwatako nnyo naye ne zitanywera.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Ali ng’ekimera ekifukirire obulungi ekiri mu musana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">nga kyanjadde amatabi gaakyo mu nnimiro;<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>emirandira gyakyo nga gyezingiridde, okwetooloola entuumu y’amayinja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">nga ginoonya ekifo mu mayinja.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Naye bwe bakiggya mu kifo kyakyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">ekifo ekyo kikyegaana ne kigamba nti, Sikulabangako.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Mazima ddala essanyu lyakyo liggwaawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">ebirime ebirala ne bikula okuva mu ttaka.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>Mazima ddala Katonda talekerera muntu ataliiko musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">era tanyweza mukono gw’abakola ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Ajja kuddamu ajjuze akamwa ko enseko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">n’emimwa gyo amaloboozi ag’essanyu.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Abalabe bo balijjula obuswavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">era n’ennyumba z’abakozi b’ebibi zirimalibwawo.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Yobu n’alyoka addamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Ddala nkimanyi nga kino kituufu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Naye omuntu asobola atya okuba omutuukirivu eri Katonda?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Wadde ng’omuntu yandyagadde okuwakana naye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">tayinza kumuddamu kibuuzo na kimu ku bibuuzo olukumi.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Amagezi ge ga nsusso, amaanyi ge mangi nnyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">ani eyali amuwakanyizza n’avaayo nga taliiko binuubule?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Asimbula ensozi ne zivaayo nga tezimanyiridde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">era n’azivuunika ng’asunguwadde.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Ensi aginyeenya n’eva mu kifo kyayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">era n’akankanya empagi zaayo.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Ayogera eri enjuba ne teyaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">akugira n’alemesa ekitangaala ky’emmunyeenye okulabika.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Ye yekka abamba eggulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">era n’atambulira ku mayengo g’ennyanja.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Ye mukozi wa Nabaliyo, entungalugoye ne Kakaaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">n’ebibinja eby’emunyeenye eby’obukiikaddyo.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Akola ebyewuunyo ebizibu okunnyonnyola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">n’akola n’ebyamagero ebitabalika.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Bw’ayita we ndi sisobola kumulaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">bw’ampitako, sisobola kumutegeera.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Bw’aba alina ky’aggya ku muntu, ani ayinza okumuziyiza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Ani ayinza okumubuuza nti kiki ky’okola?<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Katonda taziyiza busungu bwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">n’ebibinja bya Lakabu byakankanira wansi w’ebigere bye.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>Kaakano nnyinza ntya okuwakana naye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Nnyinza ntya okufuna ebigambo mpakane naye?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Wadde nga siriiko musango, sisobola kubaako kye muddamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">mba nnyinza kwegayirira bwegayirizi oyo Omulamuzi wange ankwatirwe ekisa.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Ne bwe na ndimukoowodde n’ampitaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">sirowooza nti yandimpadde ekiseera n’ampuliriza.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Yandimenyeemenye mu muyaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">nannyongerako ebiwundu awatali nsonga.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Teyandindese kuddamu mukka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">naye yandimmaliddewo ddala nga mbonaabona.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Bwe kiba nga kigambo kya maanyi bwanyi, ye wa maanyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Era bwe kiba kya kusala musango, ani alimuyita?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Ne bwe sandibaddeko musango, akamwa kange kandigunsalidde.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">Ne bwe bandinnangiridde nti siriiko kyakunenyezebwa, kandirangiridde nti gunsinze.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>“Wadde nga sirina kyakunenyezebwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">sikyefaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">obulamu bwange mbunyooma.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Byonna kye kimu, kyenva ŋŋamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">Azikiriza bonna abataliiko musango awamu n’abakozi b’ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Kawumpuli bw’aba asse mbagirawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> asekerera okubonaabona kw’abatalina musango.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Ensi yaweebwayo mu mukono gw’abakozi b’ebibi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Abikka ku maaso g’abagiramula.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Bw’aba nga si <char style="nd">Mukama</char>, kale ani?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>Kaakano ennaku zange zidduka okusinga omuddusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">zifuumuuka, tezirina kalungi ke ziraba.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Zifuumuuka ng’amaato ag’ebitoogo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amaato ag’ebitoogo gaakolebwanga mu Misiri</char></note> agadduka ennyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">ng’empungu eyanguyiriza okugenda eri omuyiggo.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Bwe ŋŋamba nti, Leka neerabire okusinda kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">oba nti neerabire obunyiikaavu bwange, nsekemu,<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>ne neekokkola okubonaabona kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">mmanyi nga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> tombale ng’ataliiko musango.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Omusango gunsinze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">lwaki nteganira obwereere?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Ne bwe nandinaabye sabbuuni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">n’engalo zange ne nzitukuza,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>era wandinsudde mu kinnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">n’engoye zange zennyini ne zinneetamwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Kubanga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> si muntu nga nze bwe ndi nti muddemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">era nti tusisinkane tuwozaŋŋanye mu mbuga z’amateeka.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Tewali mutabaganya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">ayinza kututeekako mukono gwe ffembi,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>eyandizigyeko omuggo gwa Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">entiisa ye n’erekeraawo okunzijira.<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Olwo nno nandyogedde nga simutya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">naye nga bwe kiri kaakano, sisobola.”<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>“Obulamu bwange mbukyayidde ddala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">noolwekyo leka nfukumule okwemulugunya kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">njogerere mu kulumwa kw’emmeeme yange.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Nnaagamba Katonda nti, Tonsalira musango ne gunsinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ntegeeza ky’onvunaana.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Kikusanyusa okunnyigiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">okunyooma omulimu gw’emikono gyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">n’owagira emirimu gy’abakozi b’ebibi?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Amaaso go ga mubiri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Olaba ng’omuntu bw’alaba?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Ennaku zo zisinga ez’omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">n’emyaka gyo gisinga egy’omuntu,<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>olyoke onoonye ebisobyo byange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">era obuulirize ekibi kye nkoze,<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>newaakubadde ng’omanyi nti sirina musango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">era nga tewali n’omu ayinza kunzigya mu mukono gwo?<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>“Emikono gyo gye gyammumba, gye gyankola.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Ate kaakano onookyuka okunsanyaawo?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Jjukira nti wammumba ng’ebbumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ate kaakano onoonfuula ng’enfuufu?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Tewanzitulula ng’amata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">n’onkwasa ng’omuzigo?”<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Tewannyambaza omubiri n’olususu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">n’oluka amagumba n’ebinywa n’ongatta?<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Kale wampa okuganja mu maaso go,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">era walabirira, n’omwoyo gwange.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Naye bino wabikweka mu mutima gwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">era mmanyi nga byali mu birowoozo byo.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Singa nyonoona, ondaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">era tewandindese n’otombonereza.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Bwe mba nga nsingibbwa omusango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">zinsanze nze!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Newaakubadde nga sirina musango, sisobola kuyimusa mutwe gwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">kubanga nzijjudde obuswavu era mu kunyigirizibwa kwange, mwe nsaanikiddwa.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Bwe mba ng’asituka, n’onjigga ng’empologoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">era n’onnumba n’amaanyi go amangi ennyo.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Oleeta abajulizi abajja okunnumiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">era obusungu bwo ne bweyongera gye ndi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">amayengo ne gajja okunnumba olutata.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>“Kale lwaki wanziggya mu lubuto lwa mmange?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Wandindese nga tewannabaawo liiso lyonna lindabyeko.<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Singa satondebwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">oba singa natwalibwa butereevu okuva mu lubuto ne nzikibwa.<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Ennaku zange entono kumpi teziweddeeko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Ndeka mbeeko n’akaseera ak’okusanyuka,<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>nga sinnaba kugenda mu kifo eteri kudda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">ekiri mu nsi ejjudde ekizikiza, n’ekisiikirize eky’ebuziba,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>y’ensi ey’ekizikiza ekikutte, eyeekisiikirize eky’ebuziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">era n’okutabukatabuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ng’omusana gwayo guli nga ekizikiza.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Zofali Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Awo Zofali Omunaamasi n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Ebigambo ebyo byonna bisigale nga tebiddiddwamu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Omwogezi ono anaabalibwa ng’ataliiko musango?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Okwogera kwo okutaliimu kunaatusirisa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Oduule bw’otyo wabulewo akunenya?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Ogamba Katonda nti, ‘Ebirowoozo byange tebirina nsobi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">era ndi mutukuvu mu maaso go.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Naye, singa Katonda ayogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">singa abikkula akamwa ke n’akuddamu,<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>n’akubikkulira ebyama by’amagezi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">kubanga amagezi amatuufu ddala galiko enjuuyi bbiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Manya kino: Katonda n’okwerabira yeerabira ebimu ku bibi byo.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“Osobola okupima ebyama bya Katonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Oyinza okunoonyereza ku Ayinzabyonna n’omumalayo?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Bigulumivu okusinga eggulu, kiki ky’osobola okukola?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Bikka okusinga obuziba bw’emagombe, kiki ky’osobola okumanya?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Obuwanvu bwabyo businga ensi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">era bugazi okusinga ennyanja.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>“Singa ajja n’akusibira mu kkomera era n’atuuza olukiiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ani ayinza okumuwakanya?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Mazima ddala amanya abantu abalimba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">Bw’alaba ebibi, tabifaako?<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Naye omuntu omusirusiru, talifuna magezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">ng’omwana gw’endogoyi ogw’omu nsi bwe gutayinza kuzaalibwa nga gusobola okufugibwa.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>“Naye bw’owaayo omutima gwo gy’ali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">n’ogolola emikono gyo gy’ali,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>singa oggyawo ekibi ekiri mu mukono gwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">n’otokkiriza kibi kubeera mu weema yo,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>olwo onoositula omutwe n’obwenyi bwo nga tokwatibwa nsonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">era oyimirire ng’oli munywevu awatali kutya.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Mazima ddala ojja kwerabira emitawaana gyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">olijjukira bujjukizi ng’amazzi agaayita edda.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Obulamu bujja kwaka okusinga omusana ogw’omu ttuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">n’ekizikiza kijja kufuuka ng’obudde obw’oku nkya.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Olibeera munywevu, kubanga olibeera n’essuubi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">olitunuulira ebikwetooloodde n’owummulira mu mirembe.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Oligalamira nga tewali n’omu akutiisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">era bangi abalikunoonyaako omukisa.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Naye amaaso g’abakozi b’ebibi galiremererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">era tebalisobola kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">essuubi lyabwe libeere ng’omukka ogw’enkomerero.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Awo Yobu n’amuddamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>“Awatali kubuusabuusa muli bantu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">Bwe mulifa n’amagezi gammwe ne gafa.<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Naye nange nnina amagezi ntegeera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">temunsinga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Ani atabimanyi ebyo byonna?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>Nfuuse ekisekererwa eri mikwano gyange.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">Nze eyakoowolanga Katonda n’anziramu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ne nsekererwa obusekererwa, ate nga ndi mutukuvu ataliiko musango!<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Abantu abali mu ddembe lyabwe batera okusekerera abali mu mitawaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">ng’ebizibu bwe biba ku abo ababa batuuse awazibu.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Weema z’abanyazi tezibaako mutawaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">era abo abanyiiza Katonda babeera mu ddembe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">abo abeetikka katonda waabwe mu mikono gyabwe.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>Naye buuza ensolo zijja kukuyigiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">oba ebinyonyi eby’omu bbanga binaakubuulira.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Oba yogera n’ettaka linaakusomesa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">oba ebyennyanja eby’omu nnyanja binaakunnyonnyola.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Biki ku bino ebitamanyi nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">omukono gwa <char style="nd">Mukama</char> gwe gukoze ebyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Buli bulamu bwa kitonde buli mu mukono gwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">na buli mukka ogussibwa abantu bonna.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Okutu tekugezesa bigambo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">ng’olulimi bwe lukomba ku mmere?<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Amagezi tegasangibwa mu bakaddiye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">Okuwangaala tekuleeta kutegeera?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>Katonda y’alina amagezi n’amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">y’ateesa ebigambo era y’alina okutegeera.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Ky’amenya teri ayinza kuddamu kukizimba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">ky’asiba mu kkomera tekiyinza kuteebwa.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Bw’aziyiza amazzi, ekyeeya kijja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">bw’agata gazikiriza ensi.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Ye, ye nannyini maanyi n’obuwanguzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">abalimba n’abalimbibwa bonna babe.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Aggyawo abawi b’amagezi nga tebalina kantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">abalamuzi n’abafuula abasirusiru.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Bakabaka abaggyako enjegere ze beesiba ebiwato byabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">n’abasibamu obukete.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obukete bwe bugoye bwokka abaddu abawambe bwe bakkirizibwanga okwambala.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Bakabona abatwala nga tebalina kantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">n’asuula abasajja abaanywera.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Aziba emimwa egy’abawi b’amagezi abeesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">era n’aggyawo okwolesebwa kw’abakadde.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Ayiwa ekivume ku bakungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">era n’aggya ebyokulwanyisa ku b’amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Abikkula ebintu eby’ebuziba eby’ekizikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">n’aleeta n’ebisiikirize eby’amaanyi mu kitangaala.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Afuula amawanga okuba ag’amaanyi, era n’agazikiriza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">agaziya amawanga n’agasaasaanya.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Abakulembeze baamawanga abaggyako okukola ebisaanidde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">n’abasindika nga bagwirana mu ddungu eritaliimu kkubo.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Bawammantira mu kizikiza awatali kitangaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">abaleetera okutagala ng’abatamiivu.”<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>“Laba, eriiso lyange lyalaba ebyo byonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">n’okutu kwange ne kuwulira ne mbitegeera.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Kye mumanyi nange kye mmanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">siri wa wansi ku mmwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Naye neegomba okwogera n’oyo Ayinzabyonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">era n’okuleeta ensonga zange mu maaso ga Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Naye mmwe mumpayiriza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">muli basawo abatagasa mmwe mwenna!<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Kale singa musirika!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">Olwo lwe mwandibadde n’amagezi.<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Muwulire kaakano endowooza yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">muwulirize okwegayirira kw’emimwa gyange.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Katonda munaamwogerera nga mwogera ebitali bya butuukirivu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Munaamwogerera eby’obulimba?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Munaamulaga ng’ataliiko luuyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">munaamuwoleza ensonga ze.<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Singa akukebera, anaakusanga oli bulungi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Oyinza okumulimba nga bw’oyinza okulimba abantu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Tayinza butakunenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">singa osaliriza mu bubba.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Ekitiibwa kye ekisukiridde tekyandikutiisizza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Entiisa ye teyandikuguddeko?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Ebigambo byammwe ebijjukirwa ngero za vvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">n’okwewolereza kwammwe kwa bbumba.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>Musirike nze njogere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">kyonna ekinantukako kale kintuukeko.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Lwaki neeteeka mu mitawaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">obulamu bwange ne mbutwalira mu mikono gyange?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Ne bw’anzita, mu ye mwe nnina essuubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ddala ddala nditwala ensonga zange mu maaso ge.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Ddala kino kinaavaamu okusumululwa kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">kubanga teri muntu atatya Katonda ayinza kwetantala kujja mu maaso ge!<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Muwulirize ebigambo byange n’obwegendereza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">amatu gammwe gawulire bye ŋŋamba.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Kaakano nga bwe ntegese empoza yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">mmanyi nti nzija kwejeerera.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Waliwo ayinza okuleeta emisango gye nvunaanibwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Bwe kiba bwe kityo, nzija kusirika nfe.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>Ebintu ebyo ebibiri byokka by’oba ompa, Ayi Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">awo sijja kukwekweka.<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Nzigyako omukono gwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">olekere awo okuntiisatiisa n’okunkangakanga.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Kale nno ompite nzija kukuddamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">oba leka njogere ggwe onziremu.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Nsobi meka era bibi bimeka bye nkoze?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Ndaga ekibi kyange era n’omusango gwange.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Lwaki okweka amaaso go,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">n’onfuula omulabe wo?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Onoobonyaabonya ekikoola ekifuuyiddwa omuyaga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Onooyigga ebisasiro ebikaze?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Kubanga ompadiikako ebintu ebiruma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">n’ondeetera okuddamu okwetikka ebibi byange eby’omu buvubuka.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Oteeka ebigere byange mu nvuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">era okuuma butiribiri amakubo gange mwe mpita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ng’oteeka obubonero ku bisinziiro by’ebigere byange.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>Bw’atyo omuntu bw’aggwaawo ng’ekintu ekivundu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ng’olugoye oluliiriddwa ennyenje.”<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>“Omuntu azaalibwa omukazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">abeera ku nsi akaseera katono era abeera mu kutegana.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Amulisa ng’ekimuli n’awotoka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">abulawo mangu ng’ekisiikirize, tabeerera.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Otunuulira omuntu afaanana bw’atyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Olimuleeta gy’oli asalirwe omusango?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Ani ayinza okuggya ekirongoofu mu kitali kirongoofu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Tewali n’omu!<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Ennaku z’omuntu zaagererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">wagera obungi bw’emyezi gye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">era n’oteekawo ekkomo ly’atasobola kusukka.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Kale tomufaako muleke yekka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">okutuusa lw’alimala okutuukiriza emirimu gye ng’omupakasi.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>“Wakiri waliwo essuubi ng’omuti guloka:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Bwe gutemebwa, guloka nate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">era ekikolo kyagwo ekiggya tekifa.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Emirandira gyagwo gyandikaddiyidde mu ttaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">era n’ekikonge ne kifiira mu ttaka,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>naye olw’emirandira okutambula ne ginoonya amazzi kimulisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">ne kireeta amatabi ng’ekisimbe.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Naye omuntu afa era n’agalamizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">assa ogw’enkomerero n’akoma.<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Ng’amazzi bwe gaggwa mu nnyanja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">oba omugga bwe gukalira ne guggwaawo,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>bw’atyo omuntu bw’agalamira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">era n’atasituka okutuusa eggulu bwe linaggwaawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">abantu tebajja kuzuukuka oba kuggyibwa mu tulo twabwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>“Singa kale onkweka emagombe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">era n’onziika okutuusa obusungu bwo lwe buliggwaawo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Singa ongerera ekiseera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">n’onzijukira!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Omuntu bw’afa, addamu n’abeera omulamu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Ennaku zange zonna ez’okuweereza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">nnaalindanga okuwona kwange kujje.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Olimpita nange ndikuyitaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">olyegomba ekitonde emikono gyo kye gyatonda.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Ddala ku olwo bw’olibala ebigere byange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">naye tolyekaliriza bibi byange.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Ebisobyo byange biriba bisibiddwa mu kisawo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">olibikka ku kibi kyange.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>“Naye ng’olusozi bwe luseebengerera ne luggwaawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">era ng’ejjinja bwe liva mu kifo kyalyo,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>ng’amazzi bwe gaggwereeza amayinja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">era ng’okwanjaala kwago bwe kutwala ettaka ly’oku nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">bw’atyo bw’azikiriza essuubi ly’omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Omumalamu amaanyi omuwangula lumu n’aggweerawo ddala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">okyusa enfaanana ye n’omugoba.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Abaana be bwe bafuna ekitiibwa, takimanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">bwe bagwa, takiraba.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Obulamu bw’omubiri gwe bwokka bw’awulira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">ne yeekungubagira yekka.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Erifaazi Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Awo Erifaazi Omutemani n’addamu n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Omuntu ow’amagezi yandizzeemu n’amagezi agataliimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">oba n’ajjuza olubuto lwe embuyaga ez’ebuvanjuba?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Yandiwakanye n’ebigambo ebitaliiko kye bigasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">oba okwogera ebigambo ebitalina kye bikola?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Naye onyooma Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">n’oziyiza okwewaayo eri Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Kubanga obutali butuukirivu bwo bwe buyigiriza akamwa ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">era olonzeewo okukozesa olulimi lw’abalimba.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Akamwa ko kennyini ke kakusalira omusango si nze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">emimwa gyo gyennyini gye gikulumiriza.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>“Gwe wasooka abantu bonna okuzaalibwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Oba ggwe wazaalibwa ensozi nga tezinnabaawo?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Ofaayo okuwuliriza okuteesa kwa Katonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Olowooza gwe mugezi wekka?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Kiki ky’omanyi kye tutamanyi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Kubikkulirwa ki kw’olina ffe kwe tutalina?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Ab’envi abakaddiye bali ku ludda lwaffe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">abasajja abakulu n’okusinga kitaawo.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Katonda by’akugambye ebikuzzaamu amaanyi bitono nnyo tebikumala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">ebigambo ebikubuuliddwa mu bukkakkamu?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Lwaki omutima gwo gukubuzizza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">amaaso go ne gatemereza<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>n’olyoka ofuka obusungu bwo eri Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">n’ofukumula ebigambo bwe bityo okuva mu kamwa ko?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>“Omuntu ye ani, alyoke abeere omutukuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">oba oyo azaalibwa omukazi nti ayinza okuba omutuukirivu?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Katonda bw’aba tassa bwesige mu batukuvu be,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">n’eggulu ne liba nga si ttukuvu mu maaso ge,<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>oba oleeta otya omuntu obuntu, omugwagwa era omuvundu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">anywa obutali butuukirivu nga amazzi!<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“Mpuliriza nnaakunnyonnyola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">leka nkubuulire kye ndabye:<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>abasajja ab’amagezi kye bagambye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">nga tebalina kye bakwese ku kye baafuna okuva eri bakadde baabwe<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>abo bokka abaweebwa ensi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">nga tewali mugwira agiyitamu.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Omuntu omukozi w’ebibi, aba mu kubonaabona ennaku ze zonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">n’anyigirizibwa emyaka gyonna egyamutegekerwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Amaloboozi agatiisa gajjuza amatu ge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">byonna bwe biba ng’ebiteredde, abanyazi ne bamulumba.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Atya okuva mu kizikiza adde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">ekitala kiba kimulinze okumusala.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Adda eno n’eri ng’anoonya ky’anaalya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">amanyi ng’olunaku olw’ekizikiza lumutuukiridde.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Okweraliikirira n’obubalagaze bimubuutikira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">bimujjula nga kabaka eyetegekedde olutalo.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Kubanga anyeenyerezza Katonda ekikonde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">ne yeegereegeranya ku oyo Ayinzabyonna,<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>n’agenda n’ekyejo amulumbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">n’engabo ennene enzito.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>“Wadde nga yenna yagejja amaaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">ng’ajjudde amasavu mu mbiriizi,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>wakubeera mu bibuga eby’amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ne mu bifulukwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ennyumba ezigwa okufuuka ebifunfugu.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Taddeyo kugaggawala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">n’obugagga bwe tebulirwawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">n’ebintu by’alina tebirifuna mirandira mu ttaka.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Taliwona kizikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">olulimi lw’omuliro lunaakazanga amatabi ge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">era omukka gw’omu kamwa gulimugobera wala.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Alemenga okwerimba nga yeesiga ebitaliimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">kubanga talina ky’ajja kuganyulwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Wa kusasulwa byonna ng’obudde tebunnatuuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">n’amatabi ge tegalikula.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Aliba ng’omuzabbibu ogugiddwako emizabbibu egitannaba kwengera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ng’omuzeyituuni ogukunkumula ebikoola byagwo.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Kubanga ekibiina ky’abatatya Katonda kinaabeeranga kigumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">era omuliro gunaayokyanga weema ezinaabangamu enguzi.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Baba embuto ez’ekibi ne bazaala obutali butuukirivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">embuto zaabwe zizaala obulimba.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Yobu n’addamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“Mpulidde ebintu bingi ebiri nga bino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">mwenna muli mikwano gyange egitagasa.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Ebigambo byammwe bingi, tebiikome?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Kiki ekibaluma ne mutalekeraawo kuwakana?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Nange nandyogedde nga mmwe, singa mmwe mubadde mu kifo kyange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">nandyogedde ebigambo ebisengeke obulungi ebibanyiga, ne mbanyeenyeza n’omutwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okunyeenyeza omuntu omutwe kyalaganga nga bw’onyoomye omuntu oyo. Kyali kivumo</char></note> gwange.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Naye akamwa kange kandibazizzaamu amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">ebigambo eby’essuubi okuva mu kamwa kange byandibaleetedde eddembe.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Ate bwe njogera, obulumi bwange tebuwona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">bwe nsirika era busigalawo.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Mazima ddala, Ayi Katonda, ommazeemu amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">osaanyiririzzaawo ddala ennyumba yange yonna.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Onsibye n’onyweza ekinnumiririza ddala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">obukovvu bwange bwe bukulaga bwe ndi, kirabika ne ku maaso.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Katonda annumba n’obusungu bwe n’anjuzaayuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">annumira emba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">omulabe wange antunuulira nkaliriza n’amaaso ge agafumita.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Abantu bayasamya emimwa gyabwe ne bansekerera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">bankuŋŋaanirako ne bankuba empi ku matama.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Katonda ampaddeyo eri omukozi w’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">era n’ansuula mu mikono gy’ababi.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Nnali bulungi, n’anjuzaamu wakati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">yankwata ku nsingo n’ammenyamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Anfudde ssabbaawa,<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>abakubi b’obusaale banneetoolodde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Awatali kusaasira, afumita ensigo zange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">omususa gwange ne guyiika ku ttaka.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Annumba, emirundi n’emirundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">n’anfubutukirako ng’omulwanyi omuzira.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>“Neetungidde ebikutiya eby’okukungubagiramu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ne nkweka obwenyi bwange mu nfuufu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Nzenna mmyuse amaaso olw’okukaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ekisiikirize ekikwafu ennyo kyetoolodde amaaso gange,<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>newaakubadde ng’emikono gyange tegirina bibi bye gikoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">n’okusaba kwange nga kutukuvu.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>“Ggwe ensi, tobikka ku musaayi gwange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">nneme okusirisibwa!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Era kaakano omujulirwa wange ali mu ggulu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">omuwolereza wange ali waggulu nnyo ddala.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Mikwano gyange bansekerera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">amaaso gange nga gakulukusa amaziga eri Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Ku lw’omuntu, yeegayirira eri Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ng’omuntu bwe yeegayiririra mukwano gwe.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>“Emyaka mitono eginaayitawo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">nga sinnakwata lugendo olw’obutadda.”<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Omutima gwange gwennyise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ennaku zange zisalibbwaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">entaana enninze.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Ddala abansekerera bannetoolodde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">amaaso gange gabeekengera.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>“Ompe, Ayi Katonda akakalu k’onsaba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">Ani omulala ayinza okunneeyimirira?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Ozibye emitima gyabwe obutategeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">noolwekyo toobakkirize kuwangula.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Omusajja avumirira mikwano gye olw’empeera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">alireetera amaaso g’abaana be okuziba.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>“Katonda anfudde ekisekererwa eri buli omu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">anfudde buli omu gw’afujjira amalusu mu maaso.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Amaaso gange gayimbadde olw’okunakuwala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">omubiri gwange gwonna kaakano guli nga kisiikirize.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Abantu ab’amazima beesisiwala olwa kino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">atalina musango agolokokedde ku oyo atatya Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Naye era abatuukirivu banaakwatanga amakubo gaabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">n’abo ab’emikono emirongoofu baneeyongeranga amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>“Naye mukomeewo mwenna kaakano, mujje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">naye siraba muntu mugezi mu mmwe!<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Ennaku zange ziyise entegeka zange zoonoonese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">era bwe kityo n’okwegomba kw’omutima gwange.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Abantu bano ekiro bakifuula emisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">mu kizikiza mwennyini mwe bagambira nti, Ekitangaala kinaatera okujja.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Amagombe bwe gaba nga ge maka mwe nnina essuubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">bwe njala obuliri bwange mu kizikiza,<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>ne ŋŋamba amagombe nti, ‘Ggwe kitange,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">era n’eri envunyu nti, ‘Ggwe mmange,’ oba nti, ‘Ggwe mwannyinaze,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>kale essuubi lyange liba ludda wa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Ani ayinza okuliraba?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Nalyo lirigenda eri enzigi z’emagombe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Oba tuligenda ffenna mu nfuufu?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Birudaadi Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Awo Birudaadi Omusukusi n’ayanukula n’agamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“Mulikomya ddi okufuulafuula ebigambo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Muddeemu amagezi, tulyoke twogere.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Lwaki tutwalibwa ng’ente</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">era ne tulowoozebwa okuba abasirusiru mu maaso gammwe?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Ggwe eyeyuzayuza olw’obusungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">abantu ensi bagiveeko ku lulwo, oba enjazi zive mu bifo byazo?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>“Ddala etabaaza y’omukozi w’ebibi ezikidde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">era n’omuliro gw’ekyoto kye tegukyayaka.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Ekitangaala kivudde mu weema ye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">n’ettaala eri ku mabbali ge nayo ezikidde.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Amaanyi gamuwedde, ebigere bye tebikyali bya maanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">era enkwe ze, ze zimusuula.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Eky’amazima ebigere bye byamusuula mu kitimba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">era n’atangatanga mu butimba.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Omutego gumukwata ekisinziiro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">akamasu ne kamunyweeza.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Omuguwa gumukwekerwa mu ttaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">akatego kamulindirira mu kkubo lye.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Entiisa emukanga enjuuyi zonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">era n’emugoba kigere ku kigere.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Emitawaana gimwesunga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">ekikangabwa kirindiridde okugwa kwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Kirya ebitundu by’olususu lwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">omubereberye wa walumbe amulyako emikono n’ebigere.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Aggyibwa mu bukuumi bwa weema ye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">era n’atwalibwa eri kabaka w’ebikangabwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Omuliro gumalirawo ddala byonna eby’omu weema ye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">ekibiriiti kyakira mu kifo mw’abeera.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Emirandira gye gikala wansi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">n’amatabi ge gakala waggulu.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Ekijjukizo kye kibula ku nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">talina linnya mu nsi.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Agobebwa okuva mu kitangaala, agenda mu kizikiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">n’aggyibwa mu nsi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Talina mwana wadde omuzzukulu mu bantu be,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">newaakubadde ekifo mwabeera.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Abantu ab’ebugwanjuba beewuunya ebyamutuukako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">n’ab’ebuvanjuba ne bakwatibwa ekikangabwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Ddala bw’etyo bw’ebeera ennyumba y’omukozi w’ebibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">bwe gaba bwe gatyo amaka g’oyo atamanyi Katonda.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Amuddamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu nti:<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>“Mulikomya ddi okunnyigiriza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">ne mummenya n’ebigambo?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Emirundi kkumi nga munvuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">temukwatiddwa nsonyi kunnumba.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Bwe kiba nga kituufu nti nawaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">obukyamu bwange, bwange nzekka.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Bwe muba munneegulumiririzaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">ne mukozesa obulumi bwange okunfeebya,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>mumanye nga Katonda ankoze bubi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">era anzingizza mu kitimba kye.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>“Wadde nga nkaaba nti, ‘Mpisiddwa bubi,’ siddibwamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ne bwe nkuba enduulu, tewali antaasa.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Azibye ekkubo lyange sisobola kuyita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">amakubo gange agalese mu kizikiza.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Anziggyeeko ekitiibwa kyange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">n’anziggyako n’engule ku mutwe gwange.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Anjuzaayuza ku buli ludda okutuusa lwe watasigalawo kantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">asigula essuubi lyange ng’omuti.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Obusungu bwe bumbubuukirako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">ambala ng’omu ku balabe be.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Amaggye ge galumba n’amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ganzimbako enkomera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ne gagumba okwetooloola weema yange.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>“Anziggyeeko baganda bange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">abo bwe twali tumanyiganye banviiriddeko ddala.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Ab’ekika kyange banviiriddeko ddala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">mikwano gyange ginneerabidde.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Abagenyi bange n’abaweereza bange abawala, bampisa nga gwe batamanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ne bandaba nga munnagwanga.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Mpita omuddu wange naye tawulira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">wadde nga mwegayirira n’akamwa kange.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Omukka gwange gwe nzisa, guwunyira bubi mukyala wange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">nakyayibwa baganda bange bennyini.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>N’obulenzi obuto bunsekerera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">buli lwe bundaba bunvuma.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Mikwano gyange gyonna enfirabulago gya nkyawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">abo be nnayagalanga banneefuukira.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Siriiko bwe ndi wabula ndi ddiba na magumba:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">nsigazzaawo bibuno byokka.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>“Munkwatirwe ekisa mikwano gyange, munkwatirwe ekisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">kubanga omukono gwa Katonda gunkubye.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Lwaki munjigga nga Katonda bw’anjigga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Omubiri gwe mufunye tegumala?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“Singa nno ebigambo byange byawandiikibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">Singa byawandiikibwa ku muzingo, bandiguwadde ani?<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Singa byawandiikibwa n’ekyuma ku lubaati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">oba okuwandiikibwa ku lwazi ne bibeerawo emirembe n’emirembe!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Mmanyi nga Omununuzi wange mulamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">era nga ku nkomerero aliyimirira ku nsi.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Era ng’olususu lwange bwe luweddewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">kyokka mu mubiri gwange ndiraba Katonda;<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>nze mwene ndimulaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">n’amaaso gange, Nze, so si mulala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Emmeeme yange ng’eyaayaana munda mu nze!<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>“Bwe mugamba nti, ‘Tujja kumuyigganya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">kubanga ensibuko y’emitawaana eri mu ye;’<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>nammwe bennyini musaana mutye ekitala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Kubanga obusungu buleeta okubonereza okw’ekitala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">olwo mulyoke mumanye ng’eriyo okusalirwa omusango.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Zofali Addamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Awo Zofali Omunaamasi n’amuddamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>“Ebirowoozo byange ebiteganyiziddwa binkubiriza okukuddamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">kubanga nteganyizibbwa nnyo.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Mpulidde nga nswadde olw’okunenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">okutegeera kwange kunkubiriza okuddamu.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>“Ddala omanyi nga bwe byali okuva edda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">okuva omuntu lwe yateekebwa ku nsi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>nti Enseko z’omwonoonyi ziba z’akaseera katono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">era n’essanyu ly’abatamanyi Katonda terirwawo.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Newaakubadde ng’amalala ge gatuuka ku ggulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">n’omutwe gwe ne gutuuka ku bire,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>alizikirira emirembe n’emirembe nga empitambi ye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">abo abamulaba babuuze nti, ‘Ali ludda wa?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Abulawo ng’ekirooto, n’ataddayo kulabika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">abuzeewo ng’okwolesebwa kw’ekiro.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Eriiso eryamulaba teririddayo kumulaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">taliddayo kulaba kifo kye nate.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Abaana be basaana bakolagane n’abaavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">emikono gye gyennyini gye gisaana okuwaayo obugagga bwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Amaanyi ag’ekivubuka agajjudde amagumba ge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ge ganaagalamiranga naye mu nfuufu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Okukola ebibi kuwoomerera mu kamwa ke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">era akukweka wansi w’olulimi lwe,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>tayagala kukuleka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">wadde okukuta era akukuumira mu kamwa ke.<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>Naye emmere ye erimwonoonekera mu byenda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">era erifuuka butwa bwa nsweera munda ye.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Aliwandula eby’obugagga bye yamira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Katonda alireetera olubuto lwe okubisesema.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Alinywa obutwa bw’ensweera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">amannyo g’essalambwa galimutta.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Alisubwa obugga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">n’emigga egikulukuta n’omubisi gw’enjuki n’amata.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Bye yateganira alina okubiwaayo nga tabiridde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">talinyumirwa magoba ga kusuubula kwe,<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>kubanga yanyigiriza abaavu n’abaleka nga bakaaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">yawamba amayumba g’ataazimba.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“Ddala ddala talifuna kikkusa mululu gwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">wadde okuwonya n’ebyo bye yeeterekera.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Tewali kimulekeddwawo ky’anaalya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">obugagga bwe tebujja kusigalawo.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Wakati mu kufuna ebingi okulaba ennaku kumujjira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">alibonaabonera ddala nnyo.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Ng’amaze okujjuza olubuto lwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Katonda alyoke amusumulurire obusungu bwe amukube ebikonde ebitagambika.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Bw’alidduka ekyokulwanyisa eky’ekyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">akasaale ak’ekikomo kalimufumita.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Akasaale kaliviirayo mu mugongo gwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">omumwa gwako ogumasamasa gusikibwe mu kibumba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Entiisa erimujjira.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Ekizikiza ekikutte kye kirindiridde obugagga bwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Omuliro ogutazikira gwe gulimumalawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">gwokye ebisigadde mu weema ye.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Eggulu liryolesa obutali butuukirivu bwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">ensi erimusitukirako n’emujeemera.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Ebintu by’ennyumba biritwalibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">biribulira ku lunaku lw’obusungu bwa Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Eyo y’engeri Katonda gy’asasulamu abakozi b’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">nga gwe mugabo Katonda gwe yabategekera.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>“Muwulirize n’obwegendereza ebigambo byange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">era kino kibazzeemu amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Mungumiikirizeeko nga njogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">oluvannyuma museke.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>“Okwemulugunya kwange nkw’olekezza muntu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Lwaki okugumiikiriza tekunzigwako?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Muntunuulire mwewuunye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">mujja kukwata ne ku mumwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Bwe ndowooza ku kino, nfuna entiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">omubiri gwange ne gukankana.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Lwaki abakozi b’ebibi bawangaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">ne bakaddiwa ne beeyongera n’amaanyi?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Balaba abaana baabwe bwe banywezebbwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">ezzadde lyabwe nga balaba.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Amaka gaabwe gaba n’emirembe nga temuli kutya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">omuggo gwa Katonda tegubabeerako.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Ennume zaabwe teziremererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">ente zaabwe enkazi zizaala awatali kusowola mwana gwazo.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Abaana baabwe bagendera wamu nga kisibo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">obuto ne bubeera mu kuzina.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Bayimbira ku bitaasa n’ennanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">ne basanyukira eddoboozi ly’omulere.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Emyaka gyabwe gyonna babeera bulungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">mangwago ne bakka mu ntaana.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Kyokka bagamba Katonda nti, ‘Tulekere emirembe gyaffe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Tetwegomba kumanya makubo go.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Ayinzabyonna ye ani tulyoke tumuweereze?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Kiki kye tuganyulwa bwe tumusaba?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Naye obugagga bwabwe tebuli mu mikono gyabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">noolwekyo amagezi g’abakozi b’ebibi ganneewunyisa.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Ettaala y’abakozi b’ebibi yo, ezikira emirundi emeka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Ennaku ebajjira emirundi emeka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Katonda abatuusaako obulumi, ng’abasunguwalidde.<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Bali ng’ebisasiro ebitwaalibwa empewo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">ng’ebisusunku embuyaga bye zitwala.<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Katonda abonereza abaana olw’ekibi kya bakitaabwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Asasule omuntu yennyini oyo alyoke ategeere!<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Leka amaaso ge ye yennyini galabe okuzikirira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">leka anywe ku kiruyi kya Ayinzabyonna.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Kubanga aba afaayo ki ku maka g’aba alese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">nga emyezi gye egyamutegekerwa giweddeko?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>“Eriyo ayinza okuyigiriza Katonda amagezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">kubanga asalira omusango n’abo abasinga okuba aba waggulu?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Omusajja omu afiira w’abeerera ow’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">nga munywevu ddala ali mu mirembe gye,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>omubiri gwe nga guliisiddwa bulungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">amagumba ge nga gajjudde obusomyo.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Omusajja omulala n’afa ng’alina obulumi ku mutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">nga teyafuna kintu kyonna kirungi.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Ne beebaka kye kimu mu ttaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">envunyu ne zibabikka bombi.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“Mmanyi bulungi ddala kye mulowooza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">enkwe ze mwagala okunsalira.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Mugamba nti, ‘Kaakano eruwa ennyumba y’omusajja ow’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">eweema abasajja abakozi b’ebibi mwe baabeeranga?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Temwebuuzanga ku abo abatambula eŋŋendo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Temukkiriza bye babagamba,<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>nti omusajja omukozi w’ebibi awona ku lunaku olw’emitawaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">era awona ku lunaku olw’ekiruyi?<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Ani avumirira ebikolwa bye maaso ku maaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">ani amusasula ebyo by’akoze?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Atwalibwa ku ntaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">era amalaalo ge gakuumibwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Ettaka eriri mu lusenyi limuwoomera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">abantu bonna bamugoberera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">n’abalala abatamanyiddwa muwendo ne bamukulembera.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>“Kaakano musobola mutya okuŋŋumya n’ebitaliimu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Tewali kisigaddeyo ku bye mwanzizeemu wabula obulimba!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Erifaazi Addamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Awo Erifaazi Omutemani n’addamu n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Omuntu ayinza okugasa Katonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Wadde oyo ow’amagezi ayinza okumuyamba?<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Ayinzabyonna yandifunye kwesiima ki singa wali mutuukirivu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Yandiganyuddwa ki singa amakubo go gaali magolokofu?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>“Akukangavvula lwa kumutya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">era kyava akuvunaana?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Okwonoona kwo si kunene nnyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Ebibi byo si bingi nnyo?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Kubanga waggya ku muganda wo emisingo awatali nsonga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">waggya engoye ku bantu, n’obaleka bwereere.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Tewawa bakoowu mazzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">abaagala wabamma emmere,<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>wadde nga wali musajja wa maanyi, eyalina ettaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">omusajja ow’ekitiibwa, era nga byonna ggwe nnyini byo.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Weegobako bannamwandu bagende nga toliiko ky’obawadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">abatalina bakitaabwe n’obamalamu amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Emitego kyegivudde gikwetooloola.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">Lwaki entiisa ey’amangu ekujjira?<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Lwaki enzikiza ekutte nnyo tosobola kulaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">era lwaki amataba gakubikkako?<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“Katonda tali waggulu mu ggulu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Era laba, emmunyeenye ezisingayo okuba waggulu, nga bwe ziri ewala!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Ate n’ogamba nti, ‘Katonda amanyi ki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Ayinza okulamulira mu kizikiza?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Ebire ebikutte bimubikkako, n’aba ng’atatulaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">bw’aba atambula mu bifo by’omu ggulu.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Onoosigala mu kkubo ery’edda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">abasajja abakozi b’ebibi lye baakwata?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Baatwalibwa ng’ekiseera kyabwe tekinnatuuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">emisingi gyabwe gyatwalibwa amataba.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Be bagamba Katonda nti, ‘Tulekere emirembe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Ayinzabyonna ayinza kutukola ki?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Ate nga ye, ye yajjuza ennyumba zaabwe ebintu ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">noolwekyo neewuunya nnyo amagezi g’abakozi b’ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Abatuukirivu balaba okuzikirira kwabwe ne bajaguza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">abataliiko musango babasekerera nga bagamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘Ddala abalabe baffe bazikiridde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">era omuliro gulidde obugagga bwabwe.’ <verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Gonderanga Katonda ofunenga emirembe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">mu ngeri eno ebirungi lwe binajjanga gy’oli.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Kkiriza ebiragiro ebiva mu kamwa ke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">era oteeke ebigambo bye mu mutima gwo.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Bw’onodda eri oyo Ayinzabyonna, onodda buggya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">bwonooteeka ebibi ewala ne weema yo,<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>n’oteeka n’amayinja go ag’omuwendo mu ttaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">zaabu yo eya Ofiri ku njazi z’omu mugga,<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>awo Ayinzabyonna anaabeeranga zaabu yo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">era ffeeza esingayo obulungi.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Ddala ddala olisanyukira mu oyo Ayinzabyonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">era oyimuse amaaso go eri Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Olimusaba, alikuwulira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">era olituukiriza obweyamo bwo.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Ky’olisalawo kirikolebwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">era ekitangaala kirimulisa amakubo go.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Abantu abalala bwe balisuulibwa n’ogamba nti, ‘Bayimuse!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">Olwo alirokola abagudde.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Alinunula n’oyo aliko omusango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">alinunulwa olw’obulongoofu bw’emikono gyo.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>“N’okutuusa leero okwemulugunya kwange kubalagala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">omukono gwe gunzitoowerera wadde mbadde mu kusinda.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Singa nnali mmanyi aw’okumusanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">nandisobodde okulaga gy’abeera!<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Nanditutte empoza yange gy’ali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">akamwa kange nga nkajjuzizza ensonga zange.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Nanditegedde kye yandinzizeemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ne neetegereza kye yandiŋŋambye.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Yandimpakanyizza n’amaanyi mangi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Nedda, teyandinteeseko musango.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Eyo omuntu omutuukirivu asobola okutwalayo ensonga ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">era nandisumuluddwa omulamuzi wange emirembe n’emirembe.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>“Bwe ŋŋenda ebuvanjuba, nga taliiyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">ne bwe ŋŋenda ebugwanjuba, simusangayo.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Bw’aba akola mu bukiikakkono simulaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">bw’adda mu bukiikaddyo, simulabako.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Naye amanyi amakubo mwe mpita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">bw’anaamala okungezesa, nzija kuvaamu nga zaabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Ebigere byange bimugoberedde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ntambulidde mu makubo ge nga sikyamakyama.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Saava ku biragiro by’akamwa ke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">Nayagala ebigambo by’akamwa ke okusinga emmere yange gyendya bulijjo.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>“Naye yeemalirira, ani ayinza okumuwakanya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Akola kyonna ekimusanyusa.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Weewaawo ajja kutuukiriza by’asazzeewo okunjolekeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">era bingi byategese by’akyaleeta.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Kyenva mba n’entiisa nga ndi mu maaso ge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">bwe ndowooza ku bino byonna, ne mmutya.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Katonda anafuyizza nnyo omutima gwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Ayinzabyonna antiisizza nnyo.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Naye ekizikiza tekinsirisizza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ekizikiza ekikutte ennyo ekibisse amaaso gange.”<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>“Lwaki Ayinzabyonna tagera biseera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Lwaki abo abamumanyi tebalaba nnaku zaageze?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Abantu bajjulula amayinja agalamba ensalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">ne balunda ebisolo bye babbye.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Batwala endogoyi ya mulekwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">ne batwala ennume ya nnamwandu ng’omusingo.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Basindiikiriza omunaku ne bamuggya mu kkubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">ne bawaliriza abaavu bonna mu ggwanga okwekweka.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Endogoyi ez’omu ddungu nga bwe zeeyisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">n’abaavu bagenda bategana nnyo nga balondalonda obumere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">mu ddungu mwe balonderera emmere y’abaana baabwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Essubi eririibwa ensolo zaabwe baliggya ku ttale lye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">ne banoga n’emizabbibu gy’aboonoonyi.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Olw’okubulwa engoye, basula bwereere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">tebalina kye beebikka mu mpewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Enkuba y’oku nsozi ebatobya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ne banywegera enjazi olw’okubulwa we beggama.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Omwana atalina kitaawe bamusika ku mabeere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">omwana omuwere ow’omwavu bamuwamba olw’ebbanja.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Olw’okubulwa engoye bayita bwereere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">betikka ebinywa by’emmere naye basigala tebalidde.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Basogolera emizabbibu ku mayinja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">ne basambira mu ssogolero, naye ne basigala nga balumwa ennyonta.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Okusinda kw’abantu kuwulirwa mu kibuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">n’emmeeme z’abafunye ebisago zikaabira obuyambi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Naye Katonda talina gw’asinzisa musango.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>“Waliwo abo abajeemera omusana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">abatamanyi makubo ge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">abatasigala mu kwaka kwagwo.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Omutemu agolokoka nga obudde buzibye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">n’atta omwavu n’ali mu kwetaaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">ekiro abbira ddala.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Eriiso ly’omwenzi lirinda buzibe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ng’agamba nti, ‘Tewali liiso linandaba,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">n’abikka ne ku maaso ge.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Mu kizikiza mwe basimira amayumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">kyokka emisana baba beggalidde.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">Tebaagala kitangaala.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Eri abo bonna ekizikiza ekikutte bwe budde bwabwe obw’oku makya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">Kubanga bakola omukwano n’ebitiisa eby’omu nzikiza.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>Bali ng’ebyovu ebiri kungulu ku mazzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">era omugabo gwabwe mukolimire mu nsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">Tewali musogozi n’omu alaga mu nnimiro zaabwe ez’emizabbibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Nga ekyeeya n’ebbugumu bwe bimalawo amazzi agava mu muzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">aboonoonyi bwe batyo bwe bamalibwawo emagombe.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Olubuto lunaamwerabiranga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">envunyu eneemulyanga n’ewoomerwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Tajjukirwenga nate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">omukozi w’ebibi amenyeka ng’omuti.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Bayiikiriza ne banyaga omugumba atazaala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">Tebakolera nnamwandu bya kisa.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Naye Katonda awalula ab’amaanyi olw’obuyinza bwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">Newaakubadde nga bakulaakulana, kyokka tebalina bukakafu ku bulamu bwabwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Ayinza okubaleka ne babeera mu mirembe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">n’amaaso ge gabeera ku makubo gaabwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Bayimusibwa akaseera katono, oluvannyuma nga tebakyaliwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">Bakkakkanyizibwa ne bakala ne baggyibwawo nga abalala bonna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">Basalibwa ng’emitwe gy’ebirimba by’eŋŋaano.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>“Bwe kiba nga si bwe kiri, ani anannumiriza obulimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">n’afuula okwogera kwange okutaliimu?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Birudaadi Addamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Awo Birudaadi Omusuki n’addamu n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Okufuga kwa Katonda n’entiisa ya Katonda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">ateekawo enkola entuufu mu bifo ebya waggulu mu ggulu.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Amaggye ge gasobola okubalibwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Ani atayakirwa musana gwe?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Olwo omuntu ayinza atya okwelowooza nti mutuukirivu awali Katonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Omuntu eyazaalibwa omukazi ayinza atya okuba omulongoofu?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Laba n’omwezi tegulina bye gwaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">n’emmunyeenye si nnongoofu mu maaso ge.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Ate omuntu obuntu oyo envunyu obuvunyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">omwana w’omuntu, oyo olusiriŋŋanyi, ayinza atya okwelowooza nti mulongoofu!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Ayanukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu nti,<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“Ng’oyambye oyo atalina maanyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Ng’oyambye omukono ogwo ogutalina maanyi!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Ng’amagezi ga kitalo ago g’owadde oyo atalina magezi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Ng’owadde okuluŋŋamizibwa okuyitirivu!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Ani akuyambye okwogera ebigambo ebyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Era mwoyo ki ogwogeredde mu kamwa ko?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>“Abafu kye balimu tekigumiikirizika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">n’abo abali wansi w’amazzi ne bonna abagabeeramu.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Amagombe gali bwereere mu maaso ga Katonda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">n’okuzikiriza tekulina kikubisse.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Ayanjuluza eggulu ery’obukiikakkono mu bbanga ejjereere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">awanika ensi awatali kigiwanirira.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Asiba amazzi mu bire bye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">ate ebire tebyabika olw’okuzitoowererwa.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Abikka obwenyi bw’omwezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">agwanjululizaako ebire bye.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Ateekawo ekipimo ekiraga waggulu amazzi g’ennyanja we gayita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">ng’ensalo eyawula ekitangaala n’ekizikiza.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Empagi z’eggulu zikankana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">zeewuunya olw’okunenya kwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Afuukuula ennyanja n’obuyinza bwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">n’asalaasala Lakabu mu bitundutundu n’amagezi ge.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Yafuuwa omukka ogwatereeza eggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">omukono gwe gwafumita omusota oguwulukuka.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Naye nga bino katundu butundu ku bye yakola.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Nga kye tumuwulirako katundu butundu ku ekyo ky’ali!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Ani ayinza okutegeera okubwatuka kw’obuyinza bwe?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Yobu n’ayongera okwogera kwe bw’ati nti,<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“Nga Katonda bw’ali omulamu, agaanye okusala ensonga yange mu mazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">oyo Ayinzabyonna, aleetedde emmeeme yange okulumwa,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>gye nkomye okuba nga nkyalina obulamu mu nze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">omukka gwa Katonda nga gukyali mu nnyindo zange,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>emimwa gyange tegijja kwogera butali butuukirivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">era olulimi lwange terujja kwogera bulimba.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Sirikkiriza nti muli batuufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">okutuusa lwe ndifa, siryeggyako bugolokofu bwange.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Nzija kwongera okunywerera ku butuukirivu bwange obutabuleka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">omutima gwange tegunsalira musango nga nkyali mulamu.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“Abalabe bange babeere ng’abakozi b’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">n’abo abangolokokerako babeere ng’abatali batuukirivu!<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Kubanga ssuubi ki oyo atalina Katonda ly’aba nalyo ng’asaliddwako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">nga Katonda amuggyeko obulamu?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Katonda awulira okukaaba kwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">ng’ennaku emujjidde?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Alifuna essanyu mu oyo Ayinzabyonna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Aliyita Katonda ebbanga lyonna?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>Nzija kubayigiriza ebikwata ku maanyi ga Katonda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ebikwata ku oyo Ayinzabyonna sijja kubikweka.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Weekalirize bino byonna bye mwerabiddeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">lwaki kaakano okwogera ebyo ebitalina makulu?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Empeera y’Abakozi b’Ebibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>“Eno y’empeera Katonda gy’awa abakozi b’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">omugabo omuntu omujoozi gw’afuna okuva eri oyo Ayinzabyonna:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Abaana be ne bwe baba bangi batya, enkomerero yaabwe kitala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">ezzadde lye teririfuna byakulya bibamala.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Abo abaliwona kawumpuli, balifa ne baziikibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">ne bannamwandu baabwe tebalibakaabira.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Wadde ng’atereka effeeza ng’enfuufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">n’engoye ng’entuumo y’ebbumba,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>ebyo bye yeeterekera omutuukirivu y’alibyambala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">era abo abatalina musango be baligabana effeeza ye.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Ennyumba gy’azimba eribeera ng’ey’ekiwojjolo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">ng’akasiisira akazimbiddwa omukuumi.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Agenda okwebaka nga mugagga, naye ekyo tekiddemu kubaawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">kubanga alizuukuka nga byonna biweddewo.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Entiisa erimuzingako ng’amataba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">kibuyaga amutwala ekiro mu kyama.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Embuyaga ey’ebuvanjuba emutwalira ddala n’agenda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">emuggya mu kifo kye n’amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Emukuba awatali kusaasira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">ng’adduka ave mu maanyi gaayo.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Erimukubira engalo zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">n’emusiiya okuva mu kifo kye.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>“Ddala ddala waliwo ebirombe mwe basima effeeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">n’ekifo gye balongooseza effeeza.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Ekyuma kisimibwa mu ttaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">n’ekikomo ne bakisaanuusa okukiggya mu mayinja.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Omuntu agoberera enzikiza n’anoonya eyo mu ttaka wansi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">asime ekyuma mu kizikiza ekiri wansi ennyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Asima ekinnya ekiri ewala n’abantu gye babeera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">mu bifo eteyita bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ewala okuva abantu gye bayita.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Ensi evaamu emmere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">naye wansi waayo yafuusibwa nga muliro.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Safira eva mu mayinja gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">era enfuufu yaayo erimu zaabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Tewali kinyonyi kiyizzi kimanyi kkubo lino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">wadde n’amaaso ga kamunye tegarirabanga.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Ekibinja ky’empologoma ento tekituukangayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">tewali mpologoma yali eyiseeyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Omuntu ayasa n’omukono gwe ejjinja ery’embaalebaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">n’avuunika ensozi okuviira ddala we zisibuka.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Asima ensalosalo ku njazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">n’amaaso ge galaba eby’omuwendo byonna.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Anoonya wansi mu migga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">n’aggyayo ebintu ebyakwekebwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>“Naye amagezi gasangibwa wa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Okutegeera kuva wa?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Omuntu tayinza kutegeera mugaso gwago;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">tegasangibwa mu nsi y’abalamu.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Obuziba bwogera nti, ‘Tegali mu nze,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">ennyanja eyogera nti, ‘Tegali mu nze.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Tegayinza kugulibwa na zaabu asingayo obulungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">wadde omuwendo gwago okupimibwa mu ffeeza.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Tegayinza kugulibwa na zaabu wa Ofiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">mu mayinja ag’omuwendo aga onuku oba safiro.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Zaabu n’endabirwamu tebiyinza kugenkana:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">so tegayinza kugeraageranyizibwa n’amayinja ag’omuwendo.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Kolali n’amayinja ag’endabirwamu tebyogerwa nako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">omuwendo ogugula amagezi gusinga amayinja amatwakaavu.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Topazi eva mu Esiyopya teyinza kugenkana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">tegayinza wadde okugulibwa mu zaabu etetabikiddwamu kantu konna.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>“Kale amagezi gava ludda wa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">N’okutegeera kubeera ludda wa?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Gakwekebwa okuva mu maaso g’ebintu byonna ebiramu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">era gakwekeddwa ebinyonyi by’omu bbanga.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Okuzikiriza n’Okufa kwogera nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Nawulirako buwulizi ku lugambo lwakwo mu matu gange.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Katonda ategeera ekkubo erigatuukako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">era ye yekka y’amanyi gye gabeera,<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>kubanga alaba enkomerero y’ensi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">era alaba ebintu byonna wansi w’eggulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Bwe yateekawo amaanyi g’empewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">n’apima n’amazzi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>bwe yateekera enkuba etteeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">era n’ekkubo eggulu we linaayitanga nga limyansa,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>olwo n’atunuulira amagezi n’agalangirira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">n’agateekawo, n’agagezesa.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>N’agamba omuntu nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Laba, okutya Mukama, ge magezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">n’okuleka ekibi, kwe kutegeera.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Yobu n’ayongera okwogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>“Nga nneegomba emyezi egyayita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">ennaku Katonda mwe yali nga y’andabirira,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>ettaala ye bwe yayakiranga omutwe gwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">n’ekitangaala kye bwe kyanjakiranga nga ntambulira mu kizikiza.<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Mu biro we nabeerera ow’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">omukwano gwa Katonda omuyitirivu nga gukuuma amaka gange,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>Ayinzabyonna bwe yali ng’akyali nange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">n’abaana bange nga bakyanneetoolodde,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>n’ekkubo lyange nga lisiigiddwa omuzigo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">n’olwazi nga lunfukirira omugga ogw’amafuta.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>“Bwe nalaganga ku mulyango gw’ekibuga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">ne ntuula ku ntebe mu kifo we baakubiranga enkiiko,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>abavubuka abato bandabanga ne badda ebbali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">abakadde ne basituka ne bayimirira;<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>abakungu ab’oku ntikko ne balekeraawo okwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">ne bakwata ne ku mimwa;<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>ab’ebitiibwa ne balekeraawo okwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ennimi zaabwe ne zeesibira waggulu mu kamwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Buli kutu okwampuliranga nga kwesiima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">era n’abo abandabanga nga basiima<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>kubanga nawonyanga abaavu abaakaabiranga obuyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">n’abatalina bakitaabwe abatalina abayamba.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Omusajja ng’afa, y’ansabira omukisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ne ndeetera omutima gwa nnamwandu okuyimba.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Ne nnyambala obutuukirivu ng’engoye zange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">obwenkanya bwe bwali omunagiro gwange era ekitambala kye neesiba ku mutwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Nnali maaso g’abamuzibe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">era ebigere by’abalema.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Nnali kitaawe w’abanaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ne nneyama okuwolereza besimanyiiko.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Namenyanga amannyo g’abakozi b’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">ne nziggya mu kamwa kaabwe, be baali bakutte.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>“Nalowooza nti, ‘Ndifiira mu nnyumba yange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">nga mpezezza ennaku zange nga nnyingi ng’omusenyu ogw’oku nnyanja.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Omulandira gwange gulituuka mu mazzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">era n’omusulo gulibeera ku ttabi lyange okukeesa obudde.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Ekitiibwa kyange tekirikaddiwa mu nze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">n’omutego gwange ogw’akasaale gusigale nga tegukaddiye mu mukono gwange.’ <verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>“Abantu beesunganga okumpuliriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">nga balindirira mu kasirise amagezi gange.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Bwe namalanga okwogera, nga tewaba addayo kwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ebigambo byange byagwanga mpola mpola mu matu gaabwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Bannindiriranga ng’enkuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">ne banywa ebigambo byange ng’enkuba eya ttoggo.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Bwe nabamwenyeranga nga tebakikkiriza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ekitangaala ky’oku maaso gange kyali kya muwendo gye bali.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Nabasalirangawo eky’okukola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ne ntuula nga kabaka n’amaggye ge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">nnali ng’abo ababeesabeesa abakungubazi.”<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>“Naye kaakano bansekerera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">abantu abansinga obuto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">bakitaabwe be nnandibadde nteeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">wamu n’embwa ezikuuma endiga zange.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Amaanyi g’emikono gyabwe gaali gangasa ki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">Abantu abaali baweddemu amaanyi ag’obuvubuka bwabwe,<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>abakoozimbye abaali mu bwetaavu era abayala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">bameketa ettaka ekkalu mu nsi enjereere mu budde obw’ekiro.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Banoga ebiragala ebiwoomerera ng’omunnyo mu bisaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">enkolokolo ez’omwoloola y’emmere yaabwe.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Baagobebwa bave mu bantu bannaabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">ne babaleekaanira gy’obeera nti, baali babbi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Baawalirizibwa okubeera mu migga egyakalira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">mu njazi ne mu binnya wansi mu ttaka.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Baakaabira mu bisaka ng’ensolo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">ne beekweka mu bikoola by’emiti.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Ezzadde ly’abasirusiru abatalina bwe bayitibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">baagobebwa mu nsi.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>Naye kaakano abaana baabwe bansekerera nga bannyimba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">nfuuse ekyenyinyalwa gye bali,<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>abatanjagala abanneesalako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">banguwa okunfujjira amalusu mu maaso.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Kaakano Katonda nga bw’atagguludde akasaale kange, ammazeemu amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">beeyisizza nga bwe balaba mu maaso gange.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Abantu bano bannumba ku mukono gwange ogwa ddyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">bategera ebigere byange emitego,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ne baziba amakubo banzikirize.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Banzingiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">ne banzikiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">nga tewali n’omu abayambye.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Banzingiza ng’abayita mu kituli ekigazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">bayingira nga bayita mu muwaatwa.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Nnumbiddwa ebitiisa eby’amaanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ekitiibwa kyange kifuumuuse ng’ekifuuyiddwa empewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">era n’obukuumi bwange ne bubulawo ng’ekire.”<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubonaabona kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>“Era kaakano obulamu bwange buseebengerera buggwaawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">ennaku ez’okubonaabona zinzijjidde.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Ekiro kifumita amagumba gange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">era obulumi bwe nnina tebukoma.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Mu maanyi ge amangi Katonda abeera ng’olugoye lwe nneebikka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">n’ensibibwa ng’ekitogi ky’ekyambalo kyange.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Ansuula mu bitosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">ne nfuuka ng’enfuufu n’evvu.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>“Nkukaabirira nti, Ayi Katonda, naye toddamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">nnyimirira, naye ontunuulira butunuulizi.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Onkyukira n’obusungu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">onnumba n’omukono gwo ogw’amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Onsitula mu bbanga n’ongobesa empewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">n’onziza eno n’eri mu muyaga.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Mmanyi nga olintuusa mu kufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">mu kifo kye wateekerawo abalamu bonna.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>“Ddala tewali ayamba muntu anyigirizibwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ng’akaaba mu kunyigirizibwa kwe.<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Saakaabira abo abaali mu buzibu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Emmeeme yange teyalumirirwa abaavu?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Naye bwe nanoonya obulungi, ekibi kye kyajja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">bwe nanoonya ekitangaala, ekizikiza kye kyajja.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Olubuto lwange lutokota, terusirika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">ennaku ez’okubonaabona kwange zinjolekedde.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Nzenna ŋŋenda nzirugala naye si lwa kwokebwa musana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">nnyimirira mu lukuŋŋaana, ne nsaba obuyambi.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Nfuuse muganda w’ebibe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">munne w’ebiwuugulu.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Olususu lwange luddugadde, era lususumbuka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">n’omubiri gwange gwokerera.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Ettendo lyange lifuuseemu kukaaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">n’akalere kange ne kavaamu eddoboozi ery’ebiwoobe.”<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Obutukuvu bwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Nakola endagaano n’amaaso gange;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">obutatunuulira muwala n’amaaso ag’obukaba.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Kiki Katonda kye yandinsasudde okuva waggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">omugabo ogwandivudde eri oyo Ayinzabyonna ali waggulu?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Emitawaana tegijjira abo abatali batukuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">n’okulaba ennaku ne kujjira abakola eby’obujeemu?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Amakubo gange gonna tagalaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">era tamanyi ntambula yange?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>Obanga natambulira mu bulimba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">era nga n’ekigere kyange kyayanguyiriza okukola obukuusa;<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>leka mpimibwe ku minzaani ya Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">amanye obutuukirivu bwange.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Obanga ekigere kyange kyali kikyamye okuva mu kkubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">n’omutima gwange ne gugoberera amaaso gange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">engalo zange ne zibaako ebbala lyonna;<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>kale nsige, omulala abirye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">weewaawo ebirime byange bikuulibwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>Obanga omutima gwange gwali gusendeddwasendeddwa omukazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">oba ne mmuteegera ku mulyango gwa muliraanwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>kale omukazi wange ase eŋŋaano y’omusajja omulala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">n’abasajja abalala beebake naye.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Kubanga ekyo kyandibadde kya kivve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">ekibi ekiŋŋwanira okubonerezebwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Ogwo gwandibadde muliro ogwokya okutuusa mu kuzikirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ogwandyokezza ebyange byonna bye nasimba.”<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaddu n’Abaavu Okubassaako Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“Obanga nnali nnyoomye ensonga y’omuddu wange oba omuddu wange omukazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">bwe banninaako ensonga,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>kale ndikola ntya Katonda bw’alinnyimukiramu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Era bw’alimbuuza, ndimuddamu ki?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Eyantonda mu lubuto nabo si ye yabatonda?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Ffenna si ye yatukola mu mbuto za bannyaffe?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“Obanga nnamma omwavu ekintu kyonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">era obanga nakaabya nnamwandu;<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>obanga nnali ndidde akamere kange nzekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">atalina kitaawe n’atalyako,<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>kubanga okuva mu buto bwange namulera nga kitaawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">era okuva mu lubuto lwa mmange nayamba nnamwandu.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Obanga nnali ndabye omuntu yenna ng’afa olw’okubulwa ebyambalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">oba ali mu kwetaaga atalina kye yeebikka;<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>mpozzi omutima gwe, gwe gutansiima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">olw’okumubugumya n’ebyoya by’endiga zange;<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>obanga nayimusa omukono gwange eri abatalina bakitaabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">kubanga mmanyi nti, mmanyiganye n’ab’obuyinza,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>kale omukono gwange gukutuke ku kibegabega kyange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">leka gukutukireyo mu kinywa we guyungira.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Olw’okutya okuzikirizibwa Katonda n’olw’obukulu bwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">nnali sisobola kukola bintu ng’ebyo.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“Obanga nateeka obweyamo bwange mu zaabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">oba ne ŋŋamba zaabu ennongoose nti, ‘Ggwe bwesige bwange;’<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>obanga neeyagala olw’okuba n’obugagga obungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">oba olw’okuba emikono gyange gy’ali ginfunyisizza bingi;<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>obanga nnali ntunuulidde enjuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">oba omwezi nga byaka mu kitiibwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>omutima gwange ne gusendebwasendebwa mu kyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">ne mbinywegera nga mbisaamu ekitiibwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>era n’ekyo kyandibadde kibi ekiŋŋwanyiza okusalirwa omusango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">olw’obutaba mwesigwa eri Katonda ali waggulu.”<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abalabe n’Abagwira Okubassaako Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“Obanga nasanyuka ng’omulabe wange afunye emitawaana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">oba ne njaguza olw’ebizibu ebyamutuukako,<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>sakkiriza kamwa kange kwonoona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">nga nkolimira obulamu bwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Abantu b’omu nnyumba yange bwe baba tebabuuzanga nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Ani atakkuse nnyama?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Tewali mutambuze yasula ku kkubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">kubanga oluggi lwange lwali luggule eri buli muyise.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Obanga nakweka ekibi kyange ng’abantu bwe bakola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">nga nkweka obutali butuukirivu bwange mu mutima gwange,<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>olw’okutya ekibiina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">nga ntya okuswala mu kika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ne nsirika ne ntya n’okufuluma ebweru,<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>so nga waliwo ayinza okumpulira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">leka nteekeko omukono ku mpoza yange, leka Ayinzabyonna anziremu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">n’oyo ampawaabira abiteeke mu buwandiike.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>“Ddala ddala nandibyambadde ku kibegabega kyange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">nandibyambadde ku mutwe ng’engule.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Nandimunnyonnyodde buli kifo we nalinnya ekigere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">nandimusemberedde ng’omulangira.<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“Singa ettaka lyange linkaabirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">n’ebinnya byalyo bye nsimye ne bitotobala n’amaziga;<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>obanga ndiddemu ebibala awatali kusasula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">era ne ndeetera bannannyini lyo okufa,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>leka omwennyango gumere mu kifo ky’eŋŋaano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">n’omuddo oguwunya gumere mu kifo kya sayiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Ebigambo bya Yobu byakoma wano.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Eriku Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Awo abasajja abo abasatu ne balekeraawo okwogera ne Yobu, kubanga yali yeeraba nga mutuukirivu. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Naye Eriku, mutabani wa Balakeri Omubuzi, ow’omu kika kya Laamu, n’anyiigira nnyo Yobu olw’okweraba ng’atalina musango, naye n’anenya Katonda. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Yanyiigira ne mikwano gye abasatu, kubanga baalemwa okulumiriza Yobu kyokka nga baali bamusingisizza omusango. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Eriku yali alinzeeko okwogera ne Yobu kubanga banne baali bakulu okumusinga. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Naye bwe yalaba ng’abasajja bano abasatu tebakyalina kirala kya kwogera, n’anyiiga.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Awo Eriku mutabani wa Balakeri Omubuzi n’addamu n’ayogera nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Nze ndi muto mu myaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">mmwe muli bakulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">kyenavudde ntya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">okubabuulira kye ndowooza.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Nalowoozezza nti, Emyaka gye gisaanye okwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">n’emyaka emingi gye gisaanye okuyigiriza amagezi.<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Kyokka omwoyo oguli mu muntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">nga gwe mukka gw’oyo Ayinzabyonna, gwe guwa omuntu okutegeera.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Abakadde si be bokka abalina amagezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">wadde abakulu bokka okuba nga be bategeera ekituufu.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>“Kyenva ŋŋamba nti, Mumpulirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">nange mbabuulire kye mmanyi.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Nassizzaayo omwoyo nga mwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">nawulirizza ensonga ze mwawadde nga munoonya eby’okwogera.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Nabawulirizza bulungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Kyokka tewali n’omu ku mmwe yalaze Yobu bw’ali omukyamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">tewali n’omu ku mmwe eyayanukudde ebigambo bye.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Mwegendereze temugamba nti, ‘Tusanze omuntu ow’amagezi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">muleke Katonda amuwangule so si bantu.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Kyokka Yobu ebigambo bye tabyolekezza nze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">era sijja kumuddamu na bigambo byammwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>“Basobeddwa, tebalina kya kwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">ebigambo bibaweddeko.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Kaakano nsirike busirisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">nga bayimiridde buyimirizi, nga tebalina kye boogera?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Nange nnina eky’okwogera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">era nnaayogera kye mmanyi,<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>kubanga nzijjudde ebigambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">era omwoyo ogwange gumpaliriza okwogera.<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Munda mu nze omutima guli nga wayini, asaanikiddwa mu ccupa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ng’amaliba amaggya agalindiridde okwabika.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Nteekwa okwogera, nsobole okufuna eddembe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">nteekwa okwasamya akamwa kange mbeeko kye njogera.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Sijja kubaako gwe nkwatirwa nsonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">era sijja na kuwaana muntu yenna.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Kubanga singa mpaaniriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">Omutonzi wange yandyanguye okunziggyawo.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>“Kaakano ggwe Yobu, wuliriza ebigambo byange:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ssaayo omwoyo ku byonna bye njogera.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Laba nnaatera okwasamya akamwa kange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">ebigambo byange bindi ku lulimi.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Ebigambo byange biva mu mutima omulongoofu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">olulimi lwange, mu bwesimbu, lwogera bye mmanyi.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Omwoyo wa Katonda ye yankola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">era omukka gw’oyo Ayinzabyonna gumpa obulamu.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Onnyanukule nno bw’oba osobola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">teekateeka ebigambo byo onjolekere.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Laba, nange ndi ggwe mu maaso ga Katonda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">Nange nava mu bbumba.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Tobaako ky’otya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">sijja kukunyigiriza.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>Ddala ddala oyogedde mpulira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ebigambo byennyini mbiwulidde ng’ogamba nti,<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Ndi mulongoofu sirina kibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">siriiko musango so mu nze temuli butali butuukirivu.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Kyokka Katonda anteekako omusango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">anfudde omulabe we.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Asiba ebigere byange mu nvuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">antwala okuba omulabe we.<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Naye leka nkubuulire, mu kino toli mutuufu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">Katonda asinga omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Lwaki omwemulugunyiza nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">taddamu bigambo bya muntu yenna?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Kubanga Katonda ayogerera mu ngeri emu, n’awalala n’ayogerera mu ngeri endala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">wadde ng’omuntu tassaayo mwoyo.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Mu kirooto mu kwolesebwa ekiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">ng’otulo tungi tukutte abantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">nga beebase ku bitanda byabwe,<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>aggula amatu g’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">n’abalabula n’ebyekango,<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>alyoke akyuse omuntu okumuggya mu bikolwa ebibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">n’amalala,<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>aziyize emmeeme ye okukka mu bunnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">n’obulamu bwe buleme okuzikirira n’ekitala.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>“Omuntu ayinza okubonerezebwa, olumbe ne lumulumira ku kitanda kye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">n’alumwa olutatadde mu magumba ge,<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>obulamu bwe ne bwetamira ddala emmere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">emmeeme ye n’ekyayira ddala ebyassava.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Omubiri gwe gugwako ku magumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">n’amagumba ge ne gafubutukayo gye gaali geekwese,<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>emmeeme ye n’esembera kumpi n’obunnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">obulamu bwe ne bulaga eri abo abaleeta okufa.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>Singa wabaawo malayika ku ludda lwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">amuwolereza, omu ku lukumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">okubuulira omuntu ekigwanidde;<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>yandimukwatiddwa ekisa n’amugamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Muwonye aleme kusuulibwa magombe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">mmusasulidde omutango,’<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>omubiri gwe guzzibwa buggya ng’ogw’omwana omuwere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">era guddayo ne gubeera nga bwe gwali mu nnaku ze ez’obuvubuka.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Omuntu asaba Katonda, Katonda n’amukwatirwa ekisa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Alaba amaaso ga Katonda n’ajaguza n’essanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Katonda n’amuddiza nate ekifo kye eky’obutuukirivu.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Awo omuntu n’akomawo eri abantu n’abagamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">Nayonoona, ne nkola ekyo ekitaali kirungi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">naye ne sibonerezebwa nga bwe kyali kiŋŋwanidde.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Yanunula emmeeme yange n’amponya okukka mu bunnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">kyenaava mbeera omulamu ne nsigala nga mpoomerwa ekitangaala.<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Bw’atyo Katonda bw’akola omuntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">emirundi ebiri oba esatu,<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>okuzza emmeeme ye ng’agiggya emagombe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">ekitangaala eky’obulamu kimwakire.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Yobu, weetegereze nnyo, ompulirize;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">siriikirira nkubuulire.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Bw’oba ng’olina eky’okwogera kyonna, nziraamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">yogera kubanga njagala wejjeerere.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Bwe kitaba kityo, mpuliriza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">sirika nange nnaakuyigiriza amagezi.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Awo Eriku ne yeeyongera okwogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Muwulire ebigambo byange, mmwe abasajja ab’amagezi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">mumpulirize mmwe abayivu.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Kubanga okutu kugezesa ebigambo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">ng’olulimi bwe lugezesa emmere.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Leka twesalirewo ekituufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">muleke tulondewo ekisaanidde.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Yobu agamba nti, ‘Siriiko musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">naye Katonda agaanye okusala omusango gwange mu mazima.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Wadde nga ndi mutuufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ntwalibwa okuba omulimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">wadde nga siriiko musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">akasaale ke kanteseeko ekiwundu ekitawonyezeka.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Musajja ki ali nga Yobu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">anywa okunyoomebwa ng’anywa amazzi?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Atambula n’abakozi b’ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">mukwano gw’abo abakola ebitali bya butuukirivu.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Kubanga agambye nti, ‘Omuntu talina kyaganyulwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">bw’agezaako okusanyusa Katonda.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>Noolwekyo mumpulirize mmwe abasajja abalina okutegeera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Kikafuuwe Katonda okukola ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">wadde Ayinzabyonna okukola ebikyamu.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Asasula omuntu olw’ekyo ky’aba akoze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">n’amutuusaako ebyo ebimusaanidde olw’empisa ze.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Weewaawo amazima gali nti, Katonda tasobya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">Ayinzabyonna tasaliriza musango.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Obuyinza yabuggya eri ani okukulembera ensi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Ani eyamuwa olukusa okufuga ensi yonna?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Singa asalawo n’atwala omwoyo gw’omuntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">awamu n’omukka gwe,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>abantu bonna bandizikiriridde wamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">era omuntu yandizzeeyo mu nfuufu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“Bw’oba olina okutegeera, wuliriza kino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">wuliriza kye ŋŋamba.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Oyo atayagala bwenkanya asobola okufuga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Onoosalira abatuukirivu n’oyo ow’amaanyi omusango?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Oyo si ye agamba bakabaka nti, ‘Tolina mugaso,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">n’abakungu nti, ‘Oli mukozi wa bibi,’<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>atattira balangira ku liiso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">era nga tafa ku bagagga kusinga bw’afa ku baavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">kubanga egyo gye mirimu gy’emikono gye?<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Mu kaseera buseera baba bafiiridde wakati mu ttumbi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">Abantu banyeenyezebwa ne baggyibwawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">Abo ab’amaanyi batwalibwa n’omukono ogutali gw’abantu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Amaaso ge gatunuulira amakubo g’abantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">atunuulira buli kigere kye batambula.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Teri kifo kikwafu wadde ekisiikirize eky’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">ababi gye bayinza okwekweka.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Katonda teyeetaaga kwongera kwekebejja bantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">okulabika mu maaso ge okusalirwa omusango.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Awatali kwebuuza ku muntu yenna, amenyaamenya ab’amaanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">n’ateekawo abalala mu kifo kyabwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Olw’okubanga amanyi ebikolwa byabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">abamalamu amaanyi ekiro ne babetentebwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Ababonereza olw’ebikolwa byabwe ebibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">abantu bonna nga balaba,<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>kubanga baamuvaako ne balekeraawo okumugoberera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">ne bataddayo kufaayo n’akatono ku makubo ge gonna.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Baleetera abaavu okukaaba, ne kumutuukako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">era n’awulira okukaaba kw’abanyigirizibwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Naye bw’asalawo obutabaako ky’ayogera, ani ayinza okumunenya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Bwakweka amaaso ge ani ayinza okumulaba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Eggwanga n’omuntu abalinako obuyinza bwe bumu;<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>aziyiza omuntu atatya Katonda okufuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">aleme okutega abantu emitego.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“Singa omuntu agamba Katonda nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">gunsinze, sikyaddayo kwonoona,<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>kye sitegeera kinjigirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">bwe mba nga nsobezza sikyaddayo kukikola,<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>olwo Katonda akuddemu nga bw’oyagala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">akuleke ng’ogaanye okwenenya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Kaakano ggwe olina okusalawo, so sinze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">noolwekyo mbuulira ggwe ky’omanyi.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>“Abantu abalina okutegeera mumbuulire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">abasajja abagezi abawulira muntegeeze,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Yobu ayogeza butamanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">ebigambo bye tebiriimu kwolesebwa.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Singa Yobu agezesebbwa okutuusa ku nkomerero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">olw’okwogera ng’abasajja abakozi b’ebibi!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Kubanga ku kibi kye ayongeddeko obujeemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">n’akuba mu ngalo wakati mu ffe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">n’ayongera okwogera ng’awakanya Katonda.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Eriku n’ayongera okwogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“Olowooza kiba kituufu ggwe okugamba nti, Katonda ananziggyako omusango.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Oyogera nti, obutuukirivu bwange businga obwa Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Ate obuuza nti, ‘Nganyulwa ntya?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">Kirungi ki kye nfuna mu kwonoona kwange?<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>“Nandyagadde okukuddamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ne mikwano gyo egyo gy’oli nagyo.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Tunula eri eggulu olabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">tunuulira ebire, ebiri waggulu ennyo okukusinga.<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Singa oyonoona ekyo kimukwatako kitya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Ebyonoono byo bwe byeyongera, ekyo kimukolako ki?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Bw’oba omutuukirivu, kiki ky’oba omuwadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">oba kiki ky’aba afunye okuva mu ngalo zo?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Okwonoona kwo kukosa muntu nga ggwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">era n’obutuukirivu bwo bukwata ku baana b’abantu.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>Abantu bakaaba olw’okunyigirizibwa okw’amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">balaajaanira ab’omukono ogw’amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Naye tewali n’omu agamba nti, Aluwa <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Omutonzi wange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">atuwa ennyimba ekiro,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>atuyigiriza ebingi okusinga ensolo ez’omu nsiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">era n’atufuula bagezi okusinga ebinyonyi eby’omu nsiko?<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Newaakubadde nga bakaaba, tayinza kuwulira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">n’addamu kukaaba kw’abasajja ab’amalala abakozi b’ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Ddala ddala Katonda tawuliriza kukoowoola kwabwe okwo okutaliimu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Ayinzabyonna takufaako.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Kale kiba kitya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">bw’ogamba nti tomulaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">era nti, Omusango gwo guli mu maaso ge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">era oteekwa okumulindirira;<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>oba nti, ne bw’asunguwala tabonereza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">era tafaayo nnyo ku butali butuukirivu.<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Kale nno Yobu ayasamya akamwa ke okwogera ebitaliimu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">obutamanya bumwogeza ebigambo olukunkumuli.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Eriku ne yeeyongera okwogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“Yongera okuŋŋumiikirizaako katono nkulage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">nkyalina bye nnina okwogera ebifa ku Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Amagezi ge nnina gava wala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">era mmanyi nga Omutonzi wange alamula mu bwenkanya.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Eky’amazima ebigambo byange si bikyamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">oyo akakasa by’amanyi y’ayogera naawe.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Laba, Katonda wa buyinza, tanyooma bantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">w’amaanyi, anywerera ku bigendererwa bye.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Talamya bakozi ba bibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">era awa ababonyaabonyezebwa ebibasaanira.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Taggya maaso ge ku batuukirivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">abatuuza ku ntebe ey’obwakabaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">n’abagulumiza emirembe n’emirembe.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Naye abantu bwe baba basibiddwa enjegere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">nga banywezeddwa n’emiguwa egy’okulumwa<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>n’abategeeza ensobi zaabwe, n’okwonoona kwabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">nti, beewaggudde,<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>aggula amatu gaabwe bawulirize okunenyezebwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">n’abalagira beenenye ekibi kyabwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Bwe bamugondera ne bamuweereza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ennaku zaabwe zonna balizimala mu kwesiima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">era n’emyaka gyabwe mu kusanyuka.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Naye bwe batamugondera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">baalizikirizibwa n’ekitala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">bafe nga tebalina magezi.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Ab’emitima egitatya Katonda baba n’obukyayi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">Ne bw’abasiba, tebamukaabirira abasumulule.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Bafiira mu buvubuka bwabwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">era obulamu bwabwe buzikiririra mu basajja abenzi.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Anunula anyigirizibwa mu kubonaabona kwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">n’aggula okutu kwe mu kujoogebwa kwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>“Akusendasenda okukuggya mu kamwa k’okubonaabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">akuteeke mu kifo ekigazi ekitaliimu kuziyizibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">omanye emirembe gy’emeeza yo ejjudde emmere ennungi.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Naye kaakano weetisse omugugu ogw’okusalirwa omusango abakozi b’ebibi gwe basaanira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">okusalirwa omusango n’obwenkanya byakunyweza.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Weegendereze oleme kukkiriza kusendebwasendebwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">obunene bw’enguzi buleme okukukyamya.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Obugagga bwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">oba okufuba kwo kwonna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">binaakuyamba okukuggya mu buyinike?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Teweegomba budde bwa kiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">olyoke owalule abantu okuva mu bifo byabwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Weegendereze oleme kukola bitali bya butuukirivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">by’osinga okwagala okukira okubonyaabonyezebwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>“Laba Katonda yagulumira mu maanyi ge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">ani ayigiriza nga ye?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Ani eyali amukubidde amakubo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">oba okumugamba nti, ‘Ky’okoze si kituufu?’<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Jjukira ng’oteekwa okugulumizanga emirimu gye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">abantu gye bayimba mu nnyimba.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Abantu bonna baagiraba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">omuntu agirengerera wala.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Laba, Katonda agulumizibwe! Assukiridde okutegeera kwaffe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">obungi bw’emyaka gye tebunoonyezeka.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>“Kubanga akuŋŋaanya amatondo g’amazzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">agafuuka enkuba etonnya mu bugga;<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>ebire bivaamu amazzi gaabyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">enkuba n’ekuba abantu.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Ani ayinza okutegeera engeri gy’asaasaanyamu ebire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">okubwatuka okuva ku kituuti kye?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Laba, asaasaanya okumyansa kw’eggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">era n’abikka obuziba bw’ennyanja.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Eyo y’engeri gy’afugamu amawanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">n’agawa emmere mu bungi.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Emikono gye agijjuza eraddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">n’agiragira ekube ebifo bye yeerondeddemu.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Okubwatuka kwayo kulangirira kibuyaga ajja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">n’ente ne zirangirira okujja kwayo.”<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Kino kikankanya omutima gwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ne gubuuka okuva mu kifo kyagwo.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Wuliriza okubwatuka kw’eddoboozi lye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">n’okuwuluguma okuva mu kamwa ke.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Asumulula eggulu ne limyansa wansi w’eggulu wonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">n’aliragira ligende ku nkomerero y’ensi.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Kino oluggwa, okuwuluguma kw’eddoboozi lye kwe kuddako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">abwatuka n’eddoboozi lye ery’omwanguka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">era eddoboozi lye bwe liwulirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">tewabaawo kisigala nga bwe kibadde.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Eddoboozi lya Katonda libwatuka mu ngeri ey’ekitalo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">akola ebintu ebikulu ebisukka okutegeera kwaffe.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Agamba omuzira nti, ‘Ggwa ku nsi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">ate eri enkuba etonnya nti, ‘Ttonnya nnyo.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Emirimu gya buli muntu giyimirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">buli omu n’alyoka amanya amaanyi ga Katonda.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Ensolo ne ziryoka zessogga empuku zaazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">ne zigenda zeekukuma.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Omuyaga ne gulyoka guva mu nnyumba yaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">n’obunnyogovu ne buva mu mpewo ekuŋŋunta.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Omuzira ne guva mu mukka gwa Katonda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">n’amazzi amangi ne gekwata kitole.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Ebire abijjuza amatondo g’amazzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">n’asaasaanya okumyansa kw’eggulu.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Byetooloolatooloola nga y’abiragira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ne bituukiriza byonna by’abiragira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ku nsi yonna okubeera abantu.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Bwe kuba kubonereza, oba okufukirira ensi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">oba okulaga okwagala kwe, atonnyesa enkuba.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Wuliriza kino Yobu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">sooka oyimirire olowooze ku bikolwa bya Katonda eby’ettendo.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Omanyi Katonda engeri gy’alagiramu ebire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">n’aleetera eggulu okumyansa?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Omanyi engeri ebire gye bituulamu mu bbanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:16">amakula g’emirimu gy’oyo eyatuukirira mu kumanya?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Ggwe alina ebyambalo ebibuguma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ensi bw’eba ng’ekkakkanyizibbwa embuyaga ez’obukiikaddyo,<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>oyinza okumwegattako ne mubamba eggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">eryaguma ne libeera ng’endabirwamu ensanuuse?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>“Tubuulire kye tunaamugamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">tetusobola kuwoza nsonga zaffe gy’ali olw’ekizikiza kye tulimu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Asaanidde okubuulirwa kye njagala okwogera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Eriyo omuntu yenna ayinza okusaba okumalibwawo?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Kaakano tewali n’omu ayinza kutunula mu njuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">olw’engeri gy’eyakamu ku ggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ng’empewo emaze okuyita, n’eyelula ebire.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Mu bukiikakkono evaayo zaabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Katonda ajja mu kitiibwa eky’amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Ayinzabyonna tatuukikako era agulumidde mu maanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">mu bwenkanya bwe era ne butuukirivu bwe, tawaliriza muntu yenna.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Noolwekyo abantu bamutya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">takitwala ng’ekikulu olw’abo abeerowooza okuba abagezi mu mitima gyabwe.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> Ayogera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’addamu Yobu ng’ayita mu muyaga, n’ayogera nti,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>“Ani ono aleeta ekizikiza ku kuteesa kwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">n’ebigambo ebitaliimu magezi?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Yambala ebyambalo byo ng’omusajja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">mbeeko bye nkubuuza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">naawe onziremu.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>“Wali ludda wa nga nteekawo emisingi gy’ensi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Mbuulira bw’oba otegeera.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Ani eyasalawo ebipimo byayo? Ddala oteekwa okuba ng’omanyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Oba ani eyagipima n’olukoba?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Entobo zaayo zaateekebwa ku ki?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Emunyeenye ez’oku makya bwe zaali ziyimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">era n’abaana ba Katonda bonna nga baleekaana olw’essanyu,<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>ani eyasiba enzigi n’aggalira ennyanja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">bwe yava mu lubuto lwayo?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>“Bwe nakolera ebire ekyambalo kyabyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">ne mbisibira mu kizikiza ekikwafu,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>bwe n’abiteekerawo we bikoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">ne mbiteerako emitayimbwa n’enzigi,<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>bwe nagamba nti, Wano we mutuuse we munaakoma temujja kweyongerayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">era wano amayengo gammwe ag’amalala we ganaakoma?<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>“Oba wali olagidde ku budde okukya kasookedde obaawo ku nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">oba emmambya okugiraga ekifo kyayo,<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>eryoke ekwate ensi w’ekoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">eginyeenye esuule eri ababi bagiveeko bagwe eri?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Ensi eggyayo ebyafaayo byayo n’eba ng’ebbumba wansi w’akabonero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">ebyafaayo ebyo ne byefaananyiriza olugoye.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Abakozi b’ebibi bammibwa ekitangaala kyabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">n’omukono gwabwe gwe bayimusa gumenyebwa.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>“Wali otuuseeko ku nsulo ennyanja w’esibuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">oba n’olaga mu buziba bw’ennyanja?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Wali obikuliddwa enzigi z’emagombe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Oba wali olabye enzigi z’ekisiikirize ky’okufa?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Wali otegedde obugazi bw’ensi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Byogere, oba bino byonna obimanyi.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>“Ekkubo eridda mu nnyumba omusana gye gusula liri ludda wa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">N’ekifo ekizikiza gye kisula kye kiruwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Ddala, osobola okubitwala gye bibeera?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Omanyi ekkubo erigenda gye bisula?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Ddala oteekwa okuba ng’obimanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">kubanga wali wazaalibwa dda!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>“Wali oyingidde amazzi agakwata mu butiti, gye gaterekebwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">oba wali olabye omuzira gye guterekebwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Bye nterekera ebiseera eby’emitawaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">bikozesebwe mu nnaku ez’entalo n’okulwana?<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Kkubo ki erituusa ekitangaala ky’omusana gye kisaasaanira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">oba empewo ey’ebuvanjuba gy’esaasaanira ku nsi?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Ani akubira amataba emikutu mwe ganaayita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">oba ekkubo eggulu eribwatuka mwe liyita?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Ani atonnyesa enkuba mu nsi abantu mwe batabeera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">eddungu omutali muntu yenna,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>n’okufukirira ettaka eryalekebwa awo, eryazika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">n’okulimezaako omuddo?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Enkuba erina kitaawe waayo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Ani azaala amatondo ag’omusulo?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Omuzira guva mu lubuto lw’ani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Ani azaala obutiti obukwafu obw’omu ggulu,<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>amazzi mwe gakwatira ne gakaluba ng’amayinja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">ne kungulu kw’obuziba ne kukwata?<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>“Oyinza okuziyiza okwakaayakana kwa Kakaaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">oba okutaggulula enkoba za Ntungalugoye?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Oyinza okufulumya emunyeenye ziveeyo zaake ng’ekiseera kyazo kituuse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">oba okuluŋŋamya eddubu n’abaana balyo?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Omanyi amateeka n’obufuzi bw’eggulu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Oyinza okuteekawo obufuzi bw’alyo oba obwa Katonda ku nsi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>“Oyinza okuyimusa eddoboozi lyo oleekaanire ebire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">olyoke obiggyemu amataba gakubikke?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Ggwe otuma eggulu limyanse era libwatuke?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Lisobola okukweyanjulira nti, ‘Tuutuno tuli wano’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Ani eyateeka amagezi mu mutima gw’omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">oba eyateeka okutegeera mu mmeeme?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Ani alina amagezi agabala ebire?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Ani ayinza okuwunzika ebibya by’amazzi eby’omu ggulu,<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>enfuufu ng’efuuse ettaka ekkalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">era amafunfugu ne geegattira ddala?<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>“Empologoma enkazi, oyinza okugiyiggira ky’eneerya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">oba okuliisa empologoma n’ozimalako enjala,<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>bwe zeezinga mu mpuku zaazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">oba bwe zigalamira nga ziteeze mu bisaka?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Ani awa namuŋŋoona emmere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">abaana baayo bwe bakaabirira Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">nga batambulatambula nga babuliddwa emmere?”<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“Omanyi ebiro embuzi z’oku nsozi mwe zizaalira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Oba oyinza okumanya empeewo we ziwakira?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Oyinza okubala emyezi gye zimala zizaale?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Omanyi obudde mwe zizaalira?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Zikutama ne zizaala abaana baazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">ne ziwona obulumi bw’okuzaala.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Abaana baazo bakula ne bagejjera ku ttale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">batambula ne bagenda obutadda.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Ani eyaleka entulege okwetambulira mu ddembe lyayo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Ani eyasumulula emiguwa gyayo,<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>gye nawa ensi ey’omuddo okuba amaka gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">n’ensi ey’omunnyo okubeerangamu?<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Esekerera oluyoogaano lw’ekibuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">tewuliriza kulekaana kw’abavuzi ba bidduka.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Ebuna ensozi, ly’eddundiro lyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ng’enoonya ekintu kyonna ekibisi.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Embogo eyinza okukkiriza okuba omuweereza wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">n’esula ekiro mu kisibo kyo?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Oyinza okugisiba ku muguwa n’ogirimisa olubimbi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Eyinza okukuvaako emabega ng’erima mu kiwonvu.<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Oyinza okugyesiga olw’amaanyi gaayo amangi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Oyinza okugirekera emirimu gyo egy’amaanyi?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Oyinza okugyesiga okukuleetera emmere yo ey’empeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">oba okukuleetera eŋŋaano mu gguuliro lyo?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>“Ebiwaawaatiro bya maaya bisanyusa nga byewujja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">naye ebiwaawaatiro n’ebyoya bya kalooli tebiraga kisa.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Kubanga emaaya ebiika amagi gaayo ku ttaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">n’egaleka ne gabugumira mu musenyu,<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>ne yeerabira nti, ekigere kisobola okugaasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">era nga ensolo ey’omu nsiko eyinza okugalinnya.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Obwana bwayo ebuyisa bubi ng’obutali bwayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">gy’obeera nti, yazaalira bwereere.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Kubanga Katonda teyagiwa magezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">wadde okutegeera.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Ate bw’eyanjuluza ebiwaawaatiro byayo edduke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">esoomooza embalaasi n’omugoba waayo.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“Embalaasi ggwe ogiwa amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">oba ggwe oyambaza ensingo yaayo obwoya obwewumba?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Ggwe ogisobozesa okubuuka ng’enzige</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">n’ekanga n’okukaaba kwayo okw’entiisa?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Etakula ettaka mu kiwonvu, nga yeeyagala olw’amaanyi gaayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">n’eryoka efuluma okusisinkana abalwanyi abakutte ebyokulwanyisa.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Esekerera okutya, n’eteba na kigitiisa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">Ekitala tekigitiisa kugizza mabega.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Omufuko ogujjudde obusaale gwesuukundira ku lubuto lwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">awamu n’effumu erimasamasa, n’akasaale.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Mu busungu obungi emira ettaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">tesobola kusigala mu kifo kimu ng’ekkondeere livuze.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Ekkondeere bwe livuga n’egamba nti, ‘Awo!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">N’ewunyiriza olutalo olukyali ewala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">n’ewulira n’okuleekaana kwa baduumizi b’amaggye.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Amagezi go ge gabuusa kamunye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">n’ayanjuluza ebiwaawaatiro bye e bukiikaddyo?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Ggwe olagira empungu okubuukira ewala mu bbanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">era n’ezimba n’ekisu kyayo waggulu ennyo?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Ku lwazi kw’ezimba amaka gaayo ekiro n’esula okwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">ku lwazi olunywevu olutabetentebwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Eyo gy’ekettera omuyiggo gw’eneerya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">eriiso lyayo ligulengerera wala.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Obwana bwayo bunywa omusaayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">era awali emirambo w’ebeera.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Awo <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’agamba Yobu nti,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“Oyo anoonya okuyombera ebitaliimu anaayombesa Ayinzabyonna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Oyo aleeta empaka ku Katonda, amuddemu.”<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu <char style="nd">Mukama</char> nti,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Laba, sisaanidde, kiki kye nnaakuddamu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Emimwa kangibikkeko n’engalo.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Njogedde omulundi gumu, so siddemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">weewaawo emirundi ebiri sseeyongere mulundi mulala.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Awo <char style="nd">Mukama</char> ng’ali mu muyaga ogw’amaanyi n’addamu Yobu nti,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>“Weesibe engoye zo onywere ng’omusajja.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">Ka nkubuuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">naawe onziremu.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>“Onojjulula ensala yange ey’emisango;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">ononsingisa omusango ggwe atuukiridde?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Olina omukono ng’ogwa Katonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">eddoboozi lyo lisobola okubwatuka ng’erirye?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Kale nno yambala ekitiibwa n’obukulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">weesibe ekitiibwa n’okusukkuluma osukkulume.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Yolesa obusungu bw’ekiruyi kyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">otunuulire buli wa malala omusse wansi.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Tunuulira buli musajja ow’amalala omukkakkanye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">era olinnyirire abakozi b’ebibi obabetentere we bali.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Bonna baziikire wamu mu nfuufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">emitwe gyabwe ogibikkire mu ntaana.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Nange kennyini ndyoke nzikirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ng’omukono gwo ogwa ddyo, gusobola okukuwa amaanyi.”<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaanyi g’Envubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>“Laba ekisolo ekyefaananyiriza ng’envubu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">kye natonda nga ggwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">erya omuddo ng’ente,<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>nga kirina amaanyi mayitirivu mu kiwato kyakyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">amaanyi mangi mu binywa by’olubuto lwakyo.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Kiwuuba omukira gwakyo ne guba ng’omukira gw’omuvule</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">Ebinywa by’ebisambi byakyo byakwatagana nnyo.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Amagumba gaakyo gali ng’enseke ez’ebikomo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">amagulu n’emikono ng’emitayimbwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Kibalibwa mu bitonde bya Katonda ebisooka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ate nga Katonda eyakitonda asobola okukisemberera n’ekitala kye.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Weewaawo ensozi zikireetera emmere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">eyo ku nsozi, ensolo ez’omu nsiko zonna gye zizannyira.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Wansi w’ebisiikirize by’emiti egy’amaggwa, we kyebaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">ne kyekweka mu bitoogo ne mu bitosi.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Ebisiikirize by’emiti bikibikkako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">emiti egiri ku mabbali g’omugga ne gikibikkako.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Laba omugga ne bwe gusiikuuka tekyekanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">kiba kinywevu, Yoludaani ne bwajjula n’abooga.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Eriyo omuntu yenna ayinza okukikwata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">oba okuyuza ennyindo yaakyo n’akasaale?”<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="s1">Amaanyi ga Lukwata</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“Oyinza okusikayo lukwata n’eddobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">oba okusiba olulimi lwayo n’omuguwa?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Oyinza okuyingiza omuguwa mu nnyindo zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">oba okuwummula oluba lwayo n’eddobo?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Eneekwegayirira ng’ekusaba nti, ogikwatirwe ekisa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Eneeyogera naawe mu bigambo ebigonvu?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Eneekola naawe endagaano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ogitwale ekuweereze obulamu bwayo bwonna?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Onoozannya nayo nga bw’ozannya n’akanyonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">oba okugisiba n’olukoba ng’agisibira bawala bo?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Abasuubuzi banaagiramuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">oba banaagibala ng’ekyamaguzi?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Oyinza okuvuba eddiba lyayo n’olijjuza amalobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">oba omutwe okugufumita n’amafumu agafumita ebyennyanja?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Bw’oligissaako engalo zo ekirivaamu tolikyerabira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">toliddayo kukikola!<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Essuubi lyonna ery’okugiwangula ffu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">okugirabako obulabi kimalamu amaanyi.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Teri n’omu mukambwe nnyo asobola kugyaŋŋanga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Kale, ani oyo asobola okuyimirira mu maaso gange?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Ani alina kye yali ampoze musasule?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Byonna ebiri wansi w’eggulu byange.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>“Ku bikwata ku mikono n’ebigere byayo siisirike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">amaanyi gaayo n’ekikula kyayo bya ssimbo.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Ani ayinza okugiggyako eddiba lyayo ery’oku ngulu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Ani ayinza okuyuza ekizibaawo kyayo eky’amaliba abiri?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Ani ayinza okuggula enzigi z’akamwa kaayo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">Amannyo gaayo geetooloddwa entiisa.<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Omugongo gwe gujjudde enkalala z’engabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">ezisibiddwa okumukumu.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Zonna zisibaganye nga tewali mpewo weeyita.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Zakwatagana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ziri ku zinnaazo era tezisobola kwawulibwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Bw’eyasimula, ebimyanso bijja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">n’amaaso gaayo gali nga enjuba ng’egwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Mu kamwa kaayo muvaamu ebiriro ebyaka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">Kavaamu ensasi ez’omuliro.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Mu nnyindo zaayo muvaamu omukka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">ng’ogwentamu eyeesera eri ku muliro ogw’emmuli ezaaka.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Omukka oguva mu nnyindo zaayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">gukoleeza Amanda.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Mu nsingo yaayo mulimu amaanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">n’entiisa eri mu maaso gaayo.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Emiwula gy’ennyama yaayo gyegasse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">gikutte nnyo era tegisobola kwenyeenya.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Ekifuba kyayo kigumu ng’olwazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">kigumu ng’olubengo.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Bwesituka ab’amaanyi batya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">Badduka olw’okubwatuka kwayo.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Ekitala bwe kigituukako tekirina kye kiyinza kumukolako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">oba ffumu, oba omuwunda wadde akasaale akasongovu.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Emenya ebyuma gy’obeera nti ekutulakutula bisasiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">ebyo ebikomo ebimenyaamenya ng’emiti emivundu.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Akasaale tekayinza kugiddusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">amayinja ag’envumuulo gaba nga biti gy’eri.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Embukuuli nayo eri ng’ebisusunku gy’eri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">Esekerera amafumu agakasukibwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Amagalagamba g’oku lubuto lwayo gali ng’engyo z’ensuwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">Bwe yeekulula mu bitosi ebeera ng’ekyuma ekiwuula.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Ereetera obuziba bw’ennyanja okuba ng’entamu eyeesera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">Ennyanja n’eba ng’entamu y’omuzigo ogufumbibwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Mu mazzi mw’eyise, erekamu ekkubo ery’amayengo ameeru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">ne kireeta n’ekirowoozo nti obuziba bulina envi.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Tewali kigyenkana ku nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">ekitonde ekitatya.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Enyooma buli kisolo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">Ye kabaka w’abo bonna ab’amalala.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Yobu Yeenenya nga Yeeyiyeeko Enfuufu ne Vvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Awo Yobu n’addamu <char style="nd">Mukama</char> nti,<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“Mmanyi ng’oyinza okukola ebintu byonna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">era tewali kyotegeka kyonna kiyinza kuziyizibwa.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Wabuuza nti, ‘Ani ono aziyiza okuteesa kwange atalina magezi?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Mazima ddala nayogera ebintu bye sitegeera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ebintu ebyassukirira okutegeera kwange.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>“Wulira nkwegayiridde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">nange mbeeko kye nkubuuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">onziremu.<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Amatu gange gaali gaakuwulirako dda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">naye kaakano amaaso gange gakulabye.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Kyenvudde neenyooma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">era neenenyezza mu nfuufu ne mu vvu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Nga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> amaze okwogera ebigambo bino eri Yobu, n’agamba Erifaazi Omutemani nti, “Nkunyiigidde ggwe ne mikwano gyo ababiri; kubanga temwanjogerako bituufu, ng’omuddu wange Yobu bw’akoze. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Noolwekyo kaakano mutwale ente ennume musanvu, n’endiga ennume musanvu, mugende eri omuddu wange Yobu, mweweereyo eyo ekiweebwayo ekyokebwa, n’omuddu wange Yobu ajja kubasabira, kubanga nzija kukkiriza okusaba kwe nneme okubakolako ng’obusirusiru bwammwe bwe buli. Kubanga temwanjogerako bituufu ng’omuddu wange bw’akoze.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Awo Erifaazi Omutemani, ne Birudaadi Omusuki, ne Zofali Omunaamasi ne bagenda ne bakola nga <char style="nd">Mukama</char> bwe yabalagira. Awo <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’akkiriza okusaba kwa Yobu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Awo <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’aggyawo ennaku ya Yobu bwe yamala okusabira mikwano gye. <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’awa Yobu ebintu emirundi ebiri okusinga bye yalina okusooka. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Awo baganda be bonna ne bannyina bonna ne bajja n’abo abaali bamumanyi okusooka, ne balya naye emmere mu nnyumba ye; ne bamusaasira ne bamukulisa okubonaabona kwonna <char style="nd">Mukama</char> kwe yakkiriza okumutuukako. Buli omu ku bo n’amuwaayo ffeeza nga bwe yasobola, n’empeta ya zaabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Awo <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’awa Yobu omukisa mu nnaku ze ezaasembayo n’okusinga entandikwa ye bwe yali: yafuna endiga omutwalo gumu mu enkumi nnya, n’eŋŋamira kakaaga, ne ziseddume z’ente lukumi, n’endogoyi enkazi lukumi. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Era <char style="nd">Mukama</char> n’amuwa n’abaana aboobulenzi musanvu, n’aboobuwala basatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Omuwala ow’olubereberye n’amutuuma Yemima, n’owokubiri n’amutuuma Keeziya, n’owookusatu n’amutuuma Keremukappuki, n’aboobulezi musanvu. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Awo mu nsi yonna ne wataba bakazi balungi kwenkana bawala ba Yobu. Kitaabwe n’abawa omugabo ogw’ebintu ogwenkanankana ne gwe yawa bannyinaabwe abalenzi.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Oluvannyuma lw’ebyo, Yobu n’awangaala emyaka kikumi mu ana; n’alaba ku baana be ne ku bazzukulu be okutuuka ku bannakasatwe. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>N’oluvannyuma n’afa ng’akaddiyidde ddala ng’awezezza emyaka mingi.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
